(3703070, 521736, 28070, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I haven''t tried to get one of these shots yet with the water kind of fogging out like that.  I think it''s the yellow in the plants is a little bright and distracting from the water.  Also maybe the pine needles hanging down in the top left are kind of in the way.</td>', 'I like it.  I haven''t tried to get one of these shots yet with the water kind of fogging out like that.  I think it''s the yellow in the plants is a little bright and distracting from the water.  Also maybe the pine needles hanging down in the top left are kind of in the way.', '2007-05-28 02:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
