(3703091, 519291, 21621, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, you''ve transformed what could have been a bland seascape into a very dramatic image.</td>', 'Great perspective, you''ve transformed what could have been a bland seascape into a very dramatic image.', '2007-05-28 02:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
