(3703985, 521441, 74078, '<td valign="top">Such a soft image, somewhat lost some brilliance due to the two spots in the bottom left. Well done though and would probably have enhanced the waters smoothness with a run through noise removal software to soften it further. 8</td>', 'Such a soft image, somewhat lost some brilliance due to the two spots in the bottom left. Well done though and would probably have enhanced the waters smoothness with a run through noise removal software to soften it further. 8', '2007-05-28 10:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
