(3704108, 522148, 51793, '<td valign="top">What a darling she was to pose for you. I would have liked to see the entire image in focus but I know working with kids is a pain sometimes. AWESOME idea though. Good Luck</td>', 'What a darling she was to pose for you. I would have liked to see the entire image in focus but I know working with kids is a pain sometimes. AWESOME idea though. Good Luck', '2007-05-28 10:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
