(3704129, 521128, 56254, '<td valign="top">bubbles are a good idea ... wish the background was a different color to really make them pop ...</td>', 'bubbles are a good idea ... wish the background was a different color to really make them pop ...', '2007-05-28 10:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3704131, 520373, 51793, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t look real here. I know you wanted people to see that you captured Earth, water and the color of fire but I think the picture would have done tremendously better without the earth trying to come out and attack me. You have a beautiful sky in the background and the reflection of water is great with the dock and everything and then you messed up with the giant earth. IMO.</td>', 'This just doesn''t look real here. I know you wanted people to see that you captured Earth, water and the color of fire but I think the picture would have done tremendously better without the earth trying to come out and attack me. You have a beautiful sky in the background and the reflection of water is great with the dock and everything and then you messed up with the giant earth. IMO.', '2007-05-28 10:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3704135, 521201, 43774, '<td valign="top">what a great waterfalls. Image seems to need more contrast</td>', 'what a great waterfalls. Image seems to need more contrast', '2007-05-28 10:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
