(3704255, 522227, 16488, '<td valign="top">This is the sort of shot that makes one wish they''d taken it!<br/>A tenacious little plant with a pleasant shadow featured amidst dry cracked earth that has it''s own beautiful abstraction...<br/>Well, since I didn''t take it, I''ll just have to sit here a few minutes and enjoy looking at it. Thanks!<br/>:)</td>', 'This is the sort of shot that makes one wish they''d taken it!A tenacious little plant with a pleasant shadow featured amidst dry cracked earth that has it''s own beautiful abstraction...Well, since I didn''t take it, I''ll just have to sit here a few minutes and enjoy looking at it. Thanks!:)', '2007-05-28 11:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3704257, 521499, 64795, '<td valign="top">I don''t exactly get the title, but I''m not a dweeb who docks down for titles.  Your picture clearly has the element water, so you meet the challenge.  I like the placement of the pitchers, and I surprisingly like the image grain.  It works well with the pitcher texture.  Good border.  I only wish the right vase wasn''t cropped out. 6</td>', 'I don''t exactly get the title, but I''m not a dweeb who docks down for titles.  Your picture clearly has the element water, so you meet the challenge.  I like the placement of the pitchers, and I surprisingly like the image grain.  It works well with the pitcher texture.  Good border.  I only wish the right vase wasn''t cropped out. 6', '2007-05-28 11:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3704262, 520323, 64795, '<td valign="top">Great blurred motion, pretty colors, nice composition, and neat border.  7</td>', 'Great blurred motion, pretty colors, nice composition, and neat border.  7', '2007-05-28 11:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
