(3704264, 519679, 64795, '<td valign="top">Now this, is awesome!  The stopped motion, DOF and colors are AMAZING!!!  What a great idea.  8</td>', 'Now this, is awesome!  The stopped motion, DOF and colors are AMAZING!!!  What a great idea.  8', '2007-05-28 11:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3704269, 521218, 64795, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous morning!  I love the early morning dramatic sky.  I also like the color of the lake and the reflections.  Nice job. 7</td>', 'What a gorgeous morning!  I love the early morning dramatic sky.  I also like the color of the lake and the reflections.  Nice job. 7', '2007-05-28 11:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3704295, 522333, 64795, '<td valign="top">Positives: This has good focus and good lighting.  It clearly meets the challenge.  Because you chose to center your object, it''s a bonus that it is actually centered.<br/> <br/>Negatives: Not the most exciting photo, and I bet it isn''t doing well with the voters... (if it is, then just ignore me!)  I just think overall it lacks an excitement factor.  I don''t really like the white table with black background either.<br/> <br/>Overall: Good job technically, but it just needs something more.  Maybe more dramatic lighting, a different angle, a different composition....  Hope this makes sense!  6</td>', 'Positives: This has good focus and good lighting.  It clearly meets the challenge.  Because you chose to center your object, it''s a bonus that it is actually centered. Negatives: Not the most exciting photo, and I bet it isn''t doing well with the voters... (if it is, then just ignore me!)  I just think overall it lacks an excitement factor.  I don''t really like the white table with black background either. Overall: Good job technically, but it just needs something more.  Maybe more dramatic lighting, a different angle, a different composition....  Hope this makes sense!  6', '2007-05-28 11:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
