(3704706, 521769, 749, '<td valign="top">First things first - it looks like the focus is "wrong" somehow, as the building in the middle of the shot looks oddly soft, as do the bridges. Maybe a bit more USM/sharpening would help? This is probably the biggest detractor from the shot.<br/> <br/>Secondly, framing/composition - there''s a huge amount of dead space in the foreground, which could easily have been cropped out. In fact, cropping a bit off the sky as well would have made this into a good semi-pano shot, as the bridges lead the eye nicely into the centre.<br/> <br/>Finally, the colours - it''s a very blue shot, so IMO you should either go with a blue duotone, or seriously boost the saturation of the other colours. Alternatively, this shot may work better in B&amp;W, since the water gives a good contrast texture.<br/> <br/>Hope that all helps!</td>', 'First things first - it looks like the focus is "wrong" somehow, as the building in the middle of the shot looks oddly soft, as do the bridges. Maybe a bit more USM/sharpening would help? This is probably the biggest detractor from the shot. Secondly, framing/composition - there''s a huge amount of dead space in the foreground, which could easily have been cropped out. In fact, cropping a bit off the sky as well would have made this into a good semi-pano shot, as the bridges lead the eye nicely into the centre. Finally, the colours - it''s a very blue shot, so IMO you should either go with a blue duotone, or seriously boost the saturation of the other colours. Alternatively, this shot may work better in B&W, since the water gives a good contrast texture. Hope that all helps!', '2007-05-28 13:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3704774, 522011, 31534, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, needs a little contrast</td>', 'Nice picture, needs a little contrast', '2007-05-28 13:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
