(3704963, 521682, 76198, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this pic would be greatly improved without the boat in the background (though it''s a pretty one, and probably should be photographed as well!), and if the camera were closer to the water. A little curves adjuestment might be good, too - I feel like the blacks are a little washed out, particularly in the wetsuit.</td>', 'In my opinion this pic would be greatly improved without the boat in the background (though it''s a pretty one, and probably should be photographed as well!), and if the camera were closer to the water. A little curves adjuestment might be good, too - I feel like the blacks are a little washed out, particularly in the wetsuit.', '2007-05-28 14:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3704969, 520338, 76198, '<td valign="top">Hmm... I''ll be interested to see whether this stands up to validation; if so it would be a remarkable shot to get! If it''s legal please post how you did it.<br/> <br/>Even if it passes, though, it feels very "photoshoppy"; the burn marks on the hand, the water, all look like they were added later, which I find distracting from the concept. I do like the concept...</td>', 'Hmm... I''ll be interested to see whether this stands up to validation; if so it would be a remarkable shot to get! If it''s legal please post how you did it. Even if it passes, though, it feels very "photoshoppy"; the burn marks on the hand, the water, all look like they were added later, which I find distracting from the concept. I do like the concept...', '2007-05-28 14:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3704972, 520784, 76198, '<td valign="top">Suffers from a lack of contrast and a lack of subject.</td>', 'Suffers from a lack of contrast and a lack of subject.', '2007-05-28 14:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3704977, 521169, 76198, '<td valign="top">Nice! I thought about doing this shot (though not with this bottle!) Very well done. Curious how you did the ignition - that''s what I couldn''t figure out.</td>', 'Nice! I thought about doing this shot (though not with this bottle!) Very well done. Curious how you did the ignition - that''s what I couldn''t figure out.', '2007-05-28 14:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
