(3706635, 520160, 51802, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo, but it seems to be over-sharpened.  The rocks, especially the bottom right corner, seem to have artifacts due to sharpening.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo, but it seems to be over-sharpened.  The rocks, especially the bottom right corner, seem to have artifacts due to sharpening.', '2007-05-28 23:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
