(3707119, 521257, 60173, '<td valign="top">This is very grainy, but not a bad photo. The colors are nice and the focus is nice. You just need a couple passes through a program like Neat Image.</td>', 'This is very grainy, but not a bad photo. The colors are nice and the focus is nice. You just need a couple passes through a program like Neat Image.', '2007-05-29 01:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
