(3707154, 521824, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure but a bit boring.</td>', 'Nice exposure but a bit boring.', '2007-05-29 02:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3707156, 520409, 34938, '<td valign="top">superb saturation and detail...the leaf on the rock really sets it off for me. This is a wonderful image you should be proud of. Exposure is perfect as is the composition. It will be a tough comp to win, there''s a lot of cream at the top of this one. This is one such shot. Hope it does well for you...good luck 9</td>', 'superb saturation and detail...the leaf on the rock really sets it off for me. This is a wonderful image you should be proud of. Exposure is perfect as is the composition. It will be a tough comp to win, there''s a lot of cream at the top of this one. This is one such shot. Hope it does well for you...good luck 9', '2007-05-29 02:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3707158, 521905, 60173, '<td valign="top">Hey.. there''s people on the rocks! This is way too dark. I think I like the photo, but it''s honestly so dark I can''t tell if I like it.</td>', 'Hey.. there''s people on the rocks! This is way too dark. I think I like the photo, but it''s honestly so dark I can''t tell if I like it.', '2007-05-29 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3707161, 521915, 34938, '<td valign="top">when I first saw this I didn''t have time to stop and comment, I decided I would come back and do that...<br/> <br/>This is spectacular in every way. The colours, the touch of red, the perspective, the sky, the editing...I love everything about it, and I hope you are doing well with it so far. All the very best for the challenge...I cannot fault this 10</td>', 'when I first saw this I didn''t have time to stop and comment, I decided I would come back and do that... This is spectacular in every way. The colours, the touch of red, the perspective, the sky, the editing...I love everything about it, and I hope you are doing well with it so far. All the very best for the challenge...I cannot fault this 10', '2007-05-29 02:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3707164, 519658, 34938, '<td valign="top">The colour and detail are superb, as is the composition. My only neg is the background is a little distracting, but I do like this a lot 9</td>', 'The colour and detail are superb, as is the composition. My only neg is the background is a little distracting, but I do like this a lot 9', '2007-05-29 02:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3707168, 521172, 60173, '<td valign="top">The full 640 pixel image with the right dodging and burning could do very well in this challenge. I think your water might be a little too colored. I don''t see anything too terribly wrong with this photo that can''t be fixed in post processing.</td>', 'The full 640 pixel image with the right dodging and burning could do very well in this challenge. I think your water might be a little too colored. I don''t see anything too terribly wrong with this photo that can''t be fixed in post processing.', '2007-05-29 02:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
