(3709767, 521340, 70000, '<td valign="top">A square crop would have been much more appropriate for this photo I think, and instead of having verticle on one side and horizontal on the other i think on the bottom it would have been more effective flipped so that the left side wouldn''t be so heavy compared to the other side</td>', 'A square crop would have been much more appropriate for this photo I think, and instead of having verticle on one side and horizontal on the other i think on the bottom it would have been more effective flipped so that the left side wouldn''t be so heavy compared to the other side', '2007-05-29 17:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3709805, 522371, 70000, '<td valign="top">I think barefoot and shirtless would have made a stronger statement because someone so neat and clean wouldn''t need to be sheltered by the earth would he? that''s jsut my first impression, i like the placement of the elements in the frame and your colors are nice</td>', 'I think barefoot and shirtless would have made a stronger statement because someone so neat and clean wouldn''t need to be sheltered by the earth would he? that''s jsut my first impression, i like the placement of the elements in the frame and your colors are nice', '2007-05-29 17:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
