(3709832, 521249, 70000, '<td valign="top">I wish I cuould see his feet, but I guess the point was that he was flying even though his feet were near the ground or on the ground? I think having his feet in the picture even if he is just above the ground would be more effective,</td>', 'I wish I cuould see his feet, but I guess the point was that he was flying even though his feet were near the ground or on the ground? I think having his feet in the picture even if he is just above the ground would be more effective,', '2007-05-29 17:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3709841, 521868, 70000, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, i think technically it needs some work, maybe more contrast and work with color but i really reallly like the composition, it is perfect for accentuating the dirt, it is dynamic and has motion. i like it alot</td>', 'I really like this photo, i think technically it needs some work, maybe more contrast and work with color but i really reallly like the composition, it is perfect for accentuating the dirt, it is dynamic and has motion. i like it alot', '2007-05-29 17:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3709842, 521522, 79039, '<td valign="top">o0o0o i like it</td>', 'o0o0o i like it', '2007-05-29 17:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3709852, 521672, 70000, '<td valign="top">I think there is way too much burning in on her face, it stands out and doesn''t go with the high contrast boldly colored nature of the rest of the photograph, this is a great sillhouetted capture and I don;t think you needed to lighten her body so much</td>', 'I think there is way too much burning in on her face, it stands out and doesn''t go with the high contrast boldly colored nature of the rest of the photograph, this is a great sillhouetted capture and I don;t think you needed to lighten her body so much', '2007-05-29 18:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
