(3710357, 521172, 76198, '<td valign="top">The blue color in the water is too much for me.</td>', 'The blue color in the water is too much for me.', '2007-05-29 20:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3710370, 521794, 76198, '<td valign="top">An homage, I take it? I''d have avoided the reflections on the background.</td>', 'An homage, I take it? I''d have avoided the reflections on the background.', '2007-05-29 20:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3710624, 520372, 63490, '<td valign="top">I really like the sepia tone in this one. The leaves look like they''re actually snow covered or ice. Is this a longer exposure?</td>', 'I really like the sepia tone in this one. The leaves look like they''re actually snow covered or ice. Is this a longer exposure?', '2007-05-29 21:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3710643, 522369, 63490, '<td valign="top">Cliche-ish shot. Wonderful colors but done so many times. I don''t think there''s enough detail in the sky to make the picture unique. Because the sky and water horizon blend in, I don''t see a true horizon.</td>', 'Cliche-ish shot. Wonderful colors but done so many times. I don''t think there''s enough detail in the sky to make the picture unique. Because the sky and water horizon blend in, I don''t see a true horizon.', '2007-05-29 21:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3710812, 522127, 56503, '<td valign="top">7</td>', '7', '2007-05-29 22:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3710899, 521491, 47316, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract. I think I''d like it better facing the right way though. I don''t see this going over too well here on DPC. The contrast is nice but really nothing is grabing me about this photo.</td>', 'Cool abstract. I think I''d like it better facing the right way though. I don''t see this going over too well here on DPC. The contrast is nice but really nothing is grabing me about this photo.', '2007-05-29 22:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3710912, 521810, 47316, '<td valign="top">Pretty but I think this image needs a more distict subject. Perhaps you could have made a distict arrangement or had a different type of flower as the subject, not sure. The colors are really nice and as I said, pretty image.</td>', 'Pretty but I think this image needs a more distict subject. Perhaps you could have made a distict arrangement or had a different type of flower as the subject, not sure. The colors are really nice and as I said, pretty image.', '2007-05-29 22:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3710916, 522258, 47316, '<td valign="top">Really pretty image. Nice tones and contrast.</td>', 'Really pretty image. Nice tones and contrast.', '2007-05-29 22:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3710924, 521634, 47316, '<td valign="top">The way she is holding the handle seems a little awkward to me, perhaps if she had turned it more. Pretty girl and nice concept. For me I think I''d put her in a more vibrant outfit (and perhaps colorful umbrella too) and then tone down the color of the background so she pops more. As it is now the green takes the attention away from her.</td>', 'The way she is holding the handle seems a little awkward to me, perhaps if she had turned it more. Pretty girl and nice concept. For me I think I''d put her in a more vibrant outfit (and perhaps colorful umbrella too) and then tone down the color of the background so she pops more. As it is now the green takes the attention away from her.', '2007-05-29 22:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3710934, 521476, 47316, '<td valign="top">The light on the grass is really pretty. I think I''d like to see this less soft though. I think you could have tried to get a lower angle so the grass could cover the house a bit so they go together more, as it is now they are almost like 2 conflicting subjects.</td>', 'The light on the grass is really pretty. I think I''d like to see this less soft though. I think you could have tried to get a lower angle so the grass could cover the house a bit so they go together more, as it is now they are almost like 2 conflicting subjects.', '2007-05-29 22:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
