(3711583, 522092, 67834, '<td valign="top">wow I love the smooth blue tones and the shadows created by the sculpture, it almost looks like a spider at the bottom. <br/>Technically it''s very good and I like the way the sky graduates from light to dark. I also like the way this is centered in the frame, it seems to work really well for this shot. 7</td>', 'wow I love the smooth blue tones and the shadows created by the sculpture, it almost looks like a spider at the bottom. Technically it''s very good and I like the way the sky graduates from light to dark. I also like the way this is centered in the frame, it seems to work really well for this shot. 7', '2007-05-30 00:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
