(3711601, 522342, 67834, '<td valign="top">I know focussing is a big issue with close up shots but for me personally I would have liked to have seen more of the scene in focus. It also isn''t particularly colourful and doesn''t have the wow when you first look at it. Composition is good, lighting is also good so technically is it pretty sound, just need some extra colour I think to make it a bit more interesting. 5</td>', 'I know focussing is a big issue with close up shots but for me personally I would have liked to have seen more of the scene in focus. It also isn''t particularly colourful and doesn''t have the wow when you first look at it. Composition is good, lighting is also good so technically is it pretty sound, just need some extra colour I think to make it a bit more interesting. 5', '2007-05-30 00:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
