(3719214, 521321, 42100, '<td valign="top">The blue and oranges compliment wonderfully.  Wonderful color and clarity.  These are exactly the kind of photos where I wish DPC would go to 720 or 800 pixel dimensions.  Great job!</td>', 'The blue and oranges compliment wonderfully.  Wonderful color and clarity.  These are exactly the kind of photos where I wish DPC would go to 720 or 800 pixel dimensions.  Great job!', '2007-05-31 13:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
