(3719234, 521627, 67697, '<td valign="top">Really cool that the line seems to extend from the light in the center.  Love the purple and blue sky.</td>', 'Really cool that the line seems to extend from the light in the center.  Love the purple and blue sky.', '2007-05-31 13:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
