(3719879, 522207, 73121, '<td valign="top">Too much water!  I never meet that requirement.  Great expression on this.  I like how soft this feels while still retaining a crisp look.</td>', 'Too much water!  I never meet that requirement.  Great expression on this.  I like how soft this feels while still retaining a crisp look.', '2007-05-31 16:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
