(3719912, 519793, 29474, '<td valign="top">Pity that there is not more light on the bottom of the earth glass. Nice concept, well executed.</td>', 'Pity that there is not more light on the bottom of the earth glass. Nice concept, well executed.', '2007-05-31 16:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719944, 522289, 20330, '<td valign="top">a good stock type photo.. photographed well.. nice detail &amp; sharpness.. nice lighting &amp; white balance.. only thing I see wrong is the title hehe of course water is liquid? :) I would have just called it Delta or something.. nice image nonetheless</td>', 'a good stock type photo.. photographed well.. nice detail & sharpness.. nice lighting & white balance.. only thing I see wrong is the title hehe of course water is liquid? :) I would have just called it Delta or something.. nice image nonetheless', '2007-05-31 16:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
