(3720285, 521562, 76941, '<td valign="top">For voting I''m going to assume that this little fishy is alive and well. Under that assumption I think the shot is interesting and has nice clarity. Black background was a good choice and I like the reflection. If however the fishy isn''t alive and well,then... YUCK and shame.</td>', 'For voting I''m going to assume that this little fishy is alive and well. Under that assumption I think the shot is interesting and has nice clarity. Black background was a good choice and I like the reflection. If however the fishy isn''t alive and well,then... YUCK and shame.', '2007-05-31 18:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
