(3720614, 522363, 63267, '<td valign="top">I see water as the main element here, but you have titled it after the lighthouse.  Then you have a boat thrown in as well.  All in all I think it loses the element.  I don''t know if you were going for the flat look in your PP, but too me it lacks contrast and a bit of sharpness.  Colors are also AWOL.</td>', 'I see water as the main element here, but you have titled it after the lighthouse.  Then you have a boat thrown in as well.  All in all I think it loses the element.  I don''t know if you were going for the flat look in your PP, but too me it lacks contrast and a bit of sharpness.  Colors are also AWOL.', '2007-05-31 20:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
