(3722894, 520400, 51802, '<td valign="top">Absolutely amazing shot!  This one is going into my favorites!</td>', 'Absolutely amazing shot!  This one is going into my favorites!', '2007-06-01 08:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722923, 521052, 67834, '<td valign="top">nice crisp image and love the smooth grey tones in the sky but it would be nice to see something of more interest in the foreground other than just trees. 6</td>', 'nice crisp image and love the smooth grey tones in the sky but it would be nice to see something of more interest in the foreground other than just trees. 6', '2007-06-01 08:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722931, 521573, 67834, '<td valign="top">i find this kinda strange and it reminds me of christmas. <br/>I like the sharpness of the bubbles but the flower and bubbles dont really go together and it seems somewhat unbalanced. 5</td>', 'i find this kinda strange and it reminds me of christmas. I like the sharpness of the bubbles but the flower and bubbles dont really go together and it seems somewhat unbalanced. 5', '2007-06-01 08:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722942, 521708, 67834, '<td valign="top">I dont really understand the connection between the title and the photograph as it just looks like a water fountain to me. <br/>Perhaps experimenting with a slower shutter speed would help add something else to this image, as it currently stands it is lacking in both interest and technique 3</td>', 'I dont really understand the connection between the title and the photograph as it just looks like a water fountain to me. Perhaps experimenting with a slower shutter speed would help add something else to this image, as it currently stands it is lacking in both interest and technique 3', '2007-06-01 08:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722961, 520844, 67834, '<td valign="top">first impression, this is too tightly cropped at the top and I would like to see more of the hat as i think this could add a lot to the scene. <br/>It''s very sharp and the colours are great. Personally i do not like the background and feel it would be better with a shallow depth of field or taken from a different perspective, as it currently stands there is almos too much detail in the background. It has a lot of potential and changing a few minor things could transform it into something great. 6</td>', 'first impression, this is too tightly cropped at the top and I would like to see more of the hat as i think this could add a lot to the scene. It''s very sharp and the colours are great. Personally i do not like the background and feel it would be better with a shallow depth of field or taken from a different perspective, as it currently stands there is almos too much detail in the background. It has a lot of potential and changing a few minor things could transform it into something great. 6', '2007-06-01 08:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722970, 521321, 67834, '<td valign="top">this looks familiar to me and correct me if i am wrong in saying this shot has been taken in Australia? <br/>Beautiful colours, great long exposure, extremely sharp and looks great as a panorama 7</td>', 'this looks familiar to me and correct me if i am wrong in saying this shot has been taken in Australia? Beautiful colours, great long exposure, extremely sharp and looks great as a panorama 7', '2007-06-01 08:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722973, 522183, 67834, '<td valign="top">the sunset sets this off beautifully 6</td>', 'the sunset sets this off beautifully 6', '2007-06-01 08:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722974, 522313, 67834, '<td valign="top">well you sure got me looking ;o)</td>', 'well you sure got me looking ;o)', '2007-06-01 08:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723000, 521767, 39265, '<td valign="top">Love the photo...the colors are so vibriant.</td>', 'Love the photo...the colors are so vibriant.', '2007-06-01 09:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723047, 521444, 36382, '<td valign="top">This is my fave of the challenge.  I love the light on the rain and the way the little plant is "holding on" to the twig for support.</td>', 'This is my fave of the challenge.  I love the light on the rain and the way the little plant is "holding on" to the twig for support.', '2007-06-01 09:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723061, 522145, 36382, '<td valign="top">Beautiful texture in the water in the lower half.  It''s interesting, how you have both the waterfall and the water texture, but I feel they could almost be two separate pictures.  Especially with the horizontal line of rocks cutting the picture in half.  Don''t get me wrong though, the picture is still quite awesome.  The colors are beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful texture in the water in the lower half.  It''s interesting, how you have both the waterfall and the water texture, but I feel they could almost be two separate pictures.  Especially with the horizontal line of rocks cutting the picture in half.  Don''t get me wrong though, the picture is still quite awesome.  The colors are beautiful.', '2007-06-01 09:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723115, 521842, 36382, '<td valign="top">This is clever.  Maybe a darker background would have made the flames show up a bit more.  I''m not sure about the out of focus water line and maybe even the water on the left could be cropped out.  Just my opinion of course.  You did a good job freezing the motion of the water.</td>', 'This is clever.  Maybe a darker background would have made the flames show up a bit more.  I''m not sure about the out of focus water line and maybe even the water on the left could be cropped out.  Just my opinion of course.  You did a good job freezing the motion of the water.', '2007-06-01 09:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723206, 521174, 24715, '<td valign="top">I like a lot of negative space, colors and details. However, I would have tried to place the person to the right under the moon so the fishing rod would lead into the center of the photo rather than out of it.</td>', 'I like a lot of negative space, colors and details. However, I would have tried to place the person to the right under the moon so the fishing rod would lead into the center of the photo rather than out of it.', '2007-06-01 10:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723289, 521444, 24715, '<td valign="top">Great detail and lighting! Well done!</td>', 'Great detail and lighting! Well done!', '2007-06-01 10:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723293, 521024, 24715, '<td valign="top">Very serene, I like the blues.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-04 08:42:33.</i></td>', 'Very serene, I like the blues.', '2007-06-01 10:29:39.000000', '2007-06-04 09:42:33.000000', 1),
(3723436, 521698, 53690, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the blue smoke.  The left side feels a little empty to me.</td>', 'Nice.  I like the blue smoke.  The left side feels a little empty to me.', '2007-06-01 10:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723457, 520834, 63490, '<td valign="top">Not sure how fireworks is one of the four elements.</td>', 'Not sure how fireworks is one of the four elements.', '2007-06-01 11:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723476, 521894, 63490, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this picture is reflective of any of the 4 elements. The focus is on the child, not the fire behind him.</td>', 'I don''t see how this picture is reflective of any of the 4 elements. The focus is on the child, not the fire behind him.', '2007-06-01 11:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723510, 521485, 24715, '<td valign="top">Great detail and lighting.</td>', 'Great detail and lighting.', '2007-06-01 11:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
