(3723649, 520124, 53690, '<td valign="top">This looks nice and refreshing.  Love the blue color.  I just wish the glass was in better focus.</td>', 'This looks nice and refreshing.  Love the blue color.  I just wish the glass was in better focus.', '2007-06-01 11:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723657, 521301, 53690, '<td valign="top">The idea of this picture, and really everything about it except the candle, are perfect.  I just don''t really like the candle.  I don''t know what would have worked better, but the other three look great!</td>', 'The idea of this picture, and really everything about it except the candle, are perfect.  I just don''t really like the candle.  I don''t know what would have worked better, but the other three look great!', '2007-06-01 11:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723800, 519278, 53690, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful location!  The picture seems a bit blown out to me, and perhaps the sharpening settings weren''t quite right for the leaves (especially the lower yellow ones).</td>', 'What a beautiful location!  The picture seems a bit blown out to me, and perhaps the sharpening settings weren''t quite right for the leaves (especially the lower yellow ones).', '2007-06-01 12:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723829, 521894, 53690, '<td valign="top">This is a neat idea, and turned out very nice.  I like the desat on the kid, and the expression on the face is perfect.  I wish it was a bit sharper though (just the hero, not the background) :o)</td>', 'This is a neat idea, and turned out very nice.  I like the desat on the kid, and the expression on the face is perfect.  I wish it was a bit sharper though (just the hero, not the background) :o)', '2007-06-01 12:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723841, 521499, 53690, '<td valign="top">Nice background colors for these vases/pots.  I don''t really like that the right one is slightly cut off, and the background is pretty noisy.  The tile large amount of tile on the bottom is just too empty; a different crop might help.</td>', 'Nice background colors for these vases/pots.  I don''t really like that the right one is slightly cut off, and the background is pretty noisy.  The tile large amount of tile on the bottom is just too empty; a different crop might help.', '2007-06-01 12:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723849, 521057, 53690, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of lightning.  I love the sky color too.  The city below seems a bit flat.</td>', 'Nice capture of lightning.  I love the sky color too.  The city below seems a bit flat.', '2007-06-01 12:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723885, 521950, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty - if busy - textures and tone.  There is something appealing about your photo.  It''s a subtle delivery for the 4 elements though. 7.</td>', 'Pretty - if busy - textures and tone.  There is something appealing about your photo.  It''s a subtle delivery for the 4 elements though. 7.', '2007-06-01 12:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723888, 520357, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty outlook with a good copyspace.</td>', 'Pretty outlook with a good copyspace.', '2007-06-01 12:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723892, 521410, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very ethereal.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Very ethereal.  Nice composition.', '2007-06-01 12:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723899, 521441, 51538, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pleasant evening there.  It''s a subtle image.</td>', 'Looks like a pleasant evening there.  It''s a subtle image.', '2007-06-01 12:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723910, 522330, 51538, '<td valign="top">Yours is indeed a striking photo.  Choice of b/w is apt.  The subtle wisps of cloud really add just enough detail in the sky. 8.</td>', 'Yours is indeed a striking photo.  Choice of b/w is apt.  The subtle wisps of cloud really add just enough detail in the sky. 8.', '2007-06-01 12:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723913, 519849, 39181, '<td valign="top">Stunner.  So much to look at.  Gets an 8 from me!!</td>', 'Stunner.  So much to look at.  Gets an 8 from me!!', '2007-06-01 12:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723916, 519850, 51538, '<td valign="top">Taking photos of beach scenes and timing the wavelets rushing in is not as easy as it looks.  But you have managed to take the photographer out of the photo (so-to-speak) so the viewer can simply enjoy this delightful scene.  Very pleasant. 9.</td>', 'Taking photos of beach scenes and timing the wavelets rushing in is not as easy as it looks.  But you have managed to take the photographer out of the photo (so-to-speak) so the viewer can simply enjoy this delightful scene.  Very pleasant. 9.', '2007-06-01 12:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723917, 521829, 53690, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors here.  I like the softness of the image.  The person really makes the photo.</td>', 'Lovely colors here.  I like the softness of the image.  The person really makes the photo.', '2007-06-01 12:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723925, 521976, 39181, '<td valign="top">gets an 8 from me.  Love the shot, movement conveyed is just right imo.</td>', 'gets an 8 from me.  Love the shot, movement conveyed is just right imo.', '2007-06-01 12:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723929, 522258, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely sense of expanse therein.  Very apt photo for the challenge. 9.</td>', 'Lovely sense of expanse therein.  Very apt photo for the challenge. 9.', '2007-06-01 12:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723939, 519995, 51538, '<td valign="top">That is a glorious view, rich in colour.  Certainly elemental. 9.</td>', 'That is a glorious view, rich in colour.  Certainly elemental. 9.', '2007-06-01 12:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723940, 519237, 39181, '<td valign="top">Spectacular, wonderfully exposed.  I LOVE THE WAY YOU HAVE CONVEYED THE MOVEMENT IN THE WATER.  IT CASCADES BEAUTIFULLY.  8</td>', 'Spectacular, wonderfully exposed.  I LOVE THE WAY YOU HAVE CONVEYED THE MOVEMENT IN THE WATER.  IT CASCADES BEAUTIFULLY.  8', '2007-06-01 12:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723943, 521125, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and one of the better ones in this genre.  7.</td>', 'Nicely composed and one of the better ones in this genre.  7.', '2007-06-01 12:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723950, 520579, 53690, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white here.  Great way to show the element of air.</td>', 'Nice use of black and white here.  Great way to show the element of air.', '2007-06-01 12:33:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3724023, 522211, 53690, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing the element you''re trying to portray here is fire, but I think the picnic really distracts from the candlelight.  It also seems like the brightest areas, like in the lake and on the path, are a bit too bright.</td>', 'I''m guessing the element you''re trying to portray here is fire, but I think the picnic really distracts from the candlelight.  It also seems like the brightest areas, like in the lake and on the path, are a bit too bright.', '2007-06-01 12:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724024, 522081, 53690, '<td valign="top">Yeah, it is pretty cool.  It seems a tad over-sharpened though.</td>', 'Yeah, it is pretty cool.  It seems a tad over-sharpened though.', '2007-06-01 12:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724034, 522182, 53690, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  The water is nice.  I wish that little red object wasn''t in the bottom right of the water though.</td>', 'Very pretty.  The water is nice.  I wish that little red object wasn''t in the bottom right of the water though.', '2007-06-01 12:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724040, 520714, 53690, '<td valign="top">Aaww, this is a sweet image.  She looks like she''s having a wonderful time.  I like how you captured her in motion, although I wish she was a bit sharper (easier said than done, I know).</td>', 'Aaww, this is a sweet image.  She looks like she''s having a wonderful time.  I like how you captured her in motion, although I wish she was a bit sharper (easier said than done, I know).', '2007-06-01 12:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724047, 522065, 53690, '<td valign="top">This looks like a really cool place, but there''s something about this shot that just doesn''t work for me.  I think it happened during processing, I''m sorry I really can''t explain. I vote a 5 on this.</td>', 'This looks like a really cool place, but there''s something about this shot that just doesn''t work for me.  I think it happened during processing, I''m sorry I really can''t explain. I vote a 5 on this.', '2007-06-01 12:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724086, 521736, 53690, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty waterfall, but I think there are a couple of things that are a bit off in this picture.  The greens seem a bit too yellow and bright.  Perhaps a bit of desat on the yellows would help, and some contrast (maybe adjusting brightness too, or changing the exposure).</td>', 'This is a pretty waterfall, but I think there are a couple of things that are a bit off in this picture.  The greens seem a bit too yellow and bright.  Perhaps a bit of desat on the yellows would help, and some contrast (maybe adjusting brightness too, or changing the exposure).', '2007-06-01 13:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724145, 520971, 73121, '<td valign="top">Highlights are a bit strong in places.  Color and clarity are perfect.  Good shot.</td>', 'Highlights are a bit strong in places.  Color and clarity are perfect.  Good shot.', '2007-06-01 13:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724243, 521963, 73121, '<td valign="top">I like the mid-burn capture on this.  Maybe go with less stick and more flame?</td>', 'I like the mid-burn capture on this.  Maybe go with less stick and more flame?', '2007-06-01 14:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724259, 522013, 33362, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see more of his face</td>', 'I wish I could see more of his face', '2007-06-01 14:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724266, 520821, 33362, '<td valign="top">Nice effect but I think you overdid it a bit</td>', 'Nice effect but I think you overdid it a bit', '2007-06-01 14:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724274, 521672, 33362, '<td valign="top">excelent colors. maybe if model was looking to the left it would have been better</td>', 'excelent colors. maybe if model was looking to the left it would have been better', '2007-06-01 14:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724276, 521535, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, details and colors.</td>', 'Nice framing, details and colors.', '2007-06-01 14:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724281, 520307, 33362, '<td valign="top">I don''t think tire on left helps. Maybe it needs to be in focus since everything in the image is so sharp.</td>', 'I don''t think tire on left helps. Maybe it needs to be in focus since everything in the image is so sharp.', '2007-06-01 14:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724291, 522243, 33362, '<td valign="top">Needs more DOF</td>', 'Needs more DOF', '2007-06-01 14:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724294, 521963, 33362, '<td valign="top">cool. simple but effective</td>', 'cool. simple but effective', '2007-06-01 14:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724297, 522053, 33362, '<td valign="top">where are the flowers?</td>', 'where are the flowers?', '2007-06-01 14:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
