(3724489, 522018, 42100, '<td valign="top">Dark and moody tones really work the subjects.  Normally we see the droplets as hyper-macros, but I like how this more about the "bigger picture."  Very nicely done!</td>', 'Dark and moody tones really work the subjects.  Normally we see the droplets as hyper-macros, but I like how this more about the "bigger picture."  Very nicely done!', '2007-06-01 15:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
