(3724506, 521546, 42100, '<td valign="top">Wow...impressive clarity and tones.  This works very well as an art photo, but also would work excellently in a clean-drinking water ad campaign.  Very well done!</td>', 'Wow...impressive clarity and tones.  This works very well as an art photo, but also would work excellently in a clean-drinking water ad campaign.  Very well done!', '2007-06-01 15:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
