(3727250, 519793, 74371, '<td valign="top">Good idea that meets all of them! Myself...I think this might have been a bit more impressive in color. This is nice in B&amp;W which is my favorite medium, but with color the earth would have stood out, the candle''s flame would have made it''s presence felt...and the water (maybe with a little light blue food coloring) would have jumped out at us. Sorry... <br/> <br/>(7)</td>', 'Good idea that meets all of them! Myself...I think this might have been a bit more impressive in color. This is nice in B&W which is my favorite medium, but with color the earth would have stood out, the candle''s flame would have made it''s presence felt...and the water (maybe with a little light blue food coloring) would have jumped out at us. Sorry...  (7)', '2007-06-02 00:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727253, 521491, 74371, '<td valign="top">Intriguing shot... but I cannot see the water nor the land. Oh well... I like the "oddness" of the photo anyways. Good one!</td>', 'Intriguing shot... but I cannot see the water nor the land. Oh well... I like the "oddness" of the photo anyways. Good one!', '2007-06-02 00:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727263, 521902, 74371, '<td valign="top">Might have been better if you had the lines all parallel and even! Just kidding! What a beautifully unspoiled shot. Nice all the way around!!!<br/> <br/>(7)</td>', 'Might have been better if you had the lines all parallel and even! Just kidding! What a beautifully unspoiled shot. Nice all the way around!!! (7)', '2007-06-02 00:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727266, 522363, 74371, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo! Everything is perfectly aligned and clearly focused. I especially like the subdued color. You could have increased color some but would have spoiled the shot. Great job!!!<br/> <br/>(8)</td>', 'Wonderful photo! Everything is perfectly aligned and clearly focused. I especially like the subdued color. You could have increased color some but would have spoiled the shot. Great job!!! (8)', '2007-06-02 00:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727274, 521912, 74371, '<td valign="top">Great composition and setting up of this shot. Have seen a lot of "droplet" shots over the years, but this one says a whole bunch more. Great job!!</td>', 'Great composition and setting up of this shot. Have seen a lot of "droplet" shots over the years, but this one says a whole bunch more. Great job!!', '2007-06-02 01:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727281, 520945, 74371, '<td valign="top">I love this photo-journalistic photograph. Your setup is outstanding and the DOF couldn''t be improved on. I love the way the flower is so definitely the main focus of the picture...until you see the look on the little girl''s face and realize that this is a gift to you from her... and she is so pleased to have been able to do it for you.<br/> <br/>Outstanding job!!!  And if this little lady is your child... she is adorable!!<br/> <br/>(9)</td>', 'I love this photo-journalistic photograph. Your setup is outstanding and the DOF couldn''t be improved on. I love the way the flower is so definitely the main focus of the picture...until you see the look on the little girl''s face and realize that this is a gift to you from her... and she is so pleased to have been able to do it for you. Outstanding job!!!  And if this little lady is your child... she is adorable!! (9)', '2007-06-02 01:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727287, 521795, 74371, '<td valign="top">Water...air...water in the air... so cool!!  Excellent Depth of Field. This picture is captured beautiful. If you don''t finalize high in the rankings I will be most disappointed!!<br/> <br/>(9)</td>', 'Water...air...water in the air... so cool!!  Excellent Depth of Field. This picture is captured beautiful. If you don''t finalize high in the rankings I will be most disappointed!! (9)', '2007-06-02 01:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
