(3727705, 518270, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice movement - Seems to be leaning a fraction and just a tad boring.</td>', 'Nice movement - Seems to be leaning a fraction and just a tad boring.', '2007-06-02 03:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727717, 522352, 57378, '<td valign="top">Shots like these need to be well executed as they are in a controlled environment where you have full control. This is not the case with this pic. It''s underexposed which has resulted in the grain and it looks soft which shots like these must not be. Take time and make sure you get the best possible exposure - You probably needed some extra light to light up the chalice so that the exposure of the flame would not burn out and would then match up evenly.</td>', 'Shots like these need to be well executed as they are in a controlled environment where you have full control. This is not the case with this pic. It''s underexposed which has resulted in the grain and it looks soft which shots like these must not be. Take time and make sure you get the best possible exposure - You probably needed some extra light to light up the chalice so that the exposure of the flame would not burn out and would then match up evenly.', '2007-06-02 03:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3727720, 520980, 57378, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great rugged location but let down by the too contrasty exposure.</td>', 'Looks like a great rugged location but let down by the too contrasty exposure.', '2007-06-02 03:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
