(3727735, 520617, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - Nice and sharp - Just a shame you were not on the other side so we could see the guy. Could do with some cropping off the top and bottom too.</td>', 'Nice capture - Nice and sharp - Just a shame you were not on the other side so we could see the guy. Could do with some cropping off the top and bottom too.', '2007-06-02 03:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
