(3728088, 519593, 24389, '<td valign="top">i love the colors!</td>', 'i love the colors!', '2007-06-02 09:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728206, 522048, 70270, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Nice composition, rich colors and tones.</td>', 'I like this.  Nice composition, rich colors and tones.', '2007-06-02 10:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728211, 521208, 70270, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The clouds, earth and windmill all come together, and you''ve captured the colors and feel of the landscape very well.</td>', 'Very nice.  The clouds, earth and windmill all come together, and you''ve captured the colors and feel of the landscape very well.', '2007-06-02 10:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728219, 521908, 70270, '<td valign="top">Well composed, rich colors ad pleasing to the eye. The narrow crop helps accentuate the linear feel to the landscape.  I don''t care much for the overly thick border, and wish the clouds on the left weren''t cut off on the edge, but those are minor nits.</td>', 'Well composed, rich colors ad pleasing to the eye. The narrow crop helps accentuate the linear feel to the landscape.  I don''t care much for the overly thick border, and wish the clouds on the left weren''t cut off on the edge, but those are minor nits.', '2007-06-02 10:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728222, 521821, 70270, '<td valign="top">Great bokeh, creative response to the challenge ... the blurred expression in the background is what makes this shot.</td>', 'Great bokeh, creative response to the challenge ... the blurred expression in the background is what makes this shot.', '2007-06-02 10:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728229, 522127, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice -- I like the soft blur on the petals and the contrast with the sharp edges on the drop.</td>', 'Nice -- I like the soft blur on the petals and the contrast with the sharp edges on the drop.', '2007-06-02 10:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728232, 519581, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white conversion, rich tones and full range from blacks to white.  I like the motion on the water, too.  However, I don''t think the main subject is all that interesting.  As a total composition it works, however.  7</td>', 'Nice black and white conversion, rich tones and full range from blacks to white.  I like the motion on the water, too.  However, I don''t think the main subject is all that interesting.  As a total composition it works, however.  7', '2007-06-02 10:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728245, 522186, 70270, '<td valign="top">I like the composition on this very much.  The water in the fall looks a little strange to me, compared with other pics of this nature.  Maybe the exposure was a tad long?  I''ve never tried one of these, so don''t really know what to suggest.  Still a nice picture, and a 7 from me</td>', 'I like the composition on this very much.  The water in the fall looks a little strange to me, compared with other pics of this nature.  Maybe the exposure was a tad long?  I''ve never tried one of these, so don''t really know what to suggest.  Still a nice picture, and a 7 from me', '2007-06-02 10:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728255, 520370, 70270, '<td valign="top">Bumping you up to an 8 -- I like the feel of this pic.  It really shows how getting low to a subject opens up new vistas overlooked by most people whose heads are bobbing by five or six feet above wonderful mini landscapes like this ...</td>', 'Bumping you up to an 8 -- I like the feel of this pic.  It really shows how getting low to a subject opens up new vistas overlooked by most people whose heads are bobbing by five or six feet above wonderful mini landscapes like this ...', '2007-06-02 10:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728259, 521535, 70270, '<td valign="top">Fantastic job on an old technique .. the exposure on the brick walls and concrete floor and ceiling adds just enough contrast to make this image really pop.  Bumping you a couple to a 9</td>', 'Fantastic job on an old technique .. the exposure on the brick walls and concrete floor and ceiling adds just enough contrast to make this image really pop.  Bumping you a couple to a 9', '2007-06-02 10:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728269, 521054, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nicely done ... the exposure on the "falls" is spot on, and you''ve done a nice job bringing out the rich green tones in the landscape.  8</td>', 'Nicely done ... the exposure on the "falls" is spot on, and you''ve done a nice job bringing out the rich green tones in the landscape.  8', '2007-06-02 10:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728279, 521818, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice studio shot, good sharpness, and an interesting looking subject.  Gave you a 7 mainly on the technicals.  The image doesn''t have a great emotional appeal to me, which is why its not higher.</td>', 'Nice studio shot, good sharpness, and an interesting looking subject.  Gave you a 7 mainly on the technicals.  The image doesn''t have a great emotional appeal to me, which is why its not higher.', '2007-06-02 10:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728285, 521620, 70270, '<td valign="top">Creative response to the challenge.  One thing that brings this down a bit for me is the lack of dirt close the eyes ... I know why you did that, but it kind of detracts from the impact of the image, and emphasizes the set up nature of the shot.  7</td>', 'Creative response to the challenge.  One thing that brings this down a bit for me is the lack of dirt close the eyes ... I know why you did that, but it kind of detracts from the impact of the image, and emphasizes the set up nature of the shot.  7', '2007-06-02 10:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728326, 520463, 70270, '<td valign="top">Very stark, interesting color choice that conveys the sense of an oncoming windstorm.  Missing some detail in the windmill blades.  6</td>', 'Very stark, interesting color choice that conveys the sense of an oncoming windstorm.  Missing some detail in the windmill blades.  6', '2007-06-02 11:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728334, 519593, 70270, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sky and nicely captured reflections on the water.  Bumping to an 8 ... put this at a 6 on my first pass.  There''s a lot to see in this image the longer you look.</td>', 'Wonderful sky and nicely captured reflections on the water.  Bumping to an 8 ... put this at a 6 on my first pass.  There''s a lot to see in this image the longer you look.', '2007-06-02 11:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728347, 520004, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, and great sharpness.  A bit of a stretch for the challenge, but a nice photo nonehteless.  6</td>', 'Nice capture, and great sharpness.  A bit of a stretch for the challenge, but a nice photo nonehteless.  6', '2007-06-02 11:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728363, 522365, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Missing a strong subject -- there''s not enough of the boat in the foreground to provide interest, and the water element is not a strong point of interest after the BW conversion. 5</td>', 'Good idea.  Missing a strong subject -- there''s not enough of the boat in the foreground to provide interest, and the water element is not a strong point of interest after the BW conversion. 5', '2007-06-02 11:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728366, 521441, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice ripples on the water to meet the challenge.  Focus on the duck is a bit soft.  6</td>', 'Nice ripples on the water to meet the challenge.  Focus on the duck is a bit soft.  6', '2007-06-02 11:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728374, 522368, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but nothing new or unique here.  A bit of a stretch for the challenge, since the subject is the flower not the water.  6</td>', 'Nice shot, but nothing new or unique here.  A bit of a stretch for the challenge, since the subject is the flower not the water.  6', '2007-06-02 11:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728387, 522318, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, and good use of DOF, though a little soft in spots inside the dandelion.  I think this could have been helped a lot if one or two of the dandelion "feathers" were floating away on the wind on the left side of this shot, as that would have really illustrated the wind element and popped this to the next level.  6</td>', 'Nice shot, and good use of DOF, though a little soft in spots inside the dandelion.  I think this could have been helped a lot if one or two of the dandelion "feathers" were floating away on the wind on the left side of this shot, as that would have really illustrated the wind element and popped this to the next level.  6', '2007-06-02 11:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728389, 519997, 70270, '<td valign="top">Simple, zen-like composition.  Well exposed and a nice idea.  Bumping you to a 7</td>', 'Simple, zen-like composition.  Well exposed and a nice idea.  Bumping you to a 7', '2007-06-02 11:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728406, 520432, 70270, '<td valign="top">I bet this will do really well in the competition -- its just the kind of image that DPCers love.  For me, this type of shot is great on the first look, but doesn''t have a lot of staying power ... the more you look, the less there is to see.  That''s why its a 6 from me.<br/> <br/>On the technicals: the exposure on the drop is very nice, but the fish is a bit soft.  My guess is the fish might be a picture on a computer monitor behind the drop?</td>', 'I bet this will do really well in the competition -- its just the kind of image that DPCers love.  For me, this type of shot is great on the first look, but doesn''t have a lot of staying power ... the more you look, the less there is to see.  That''s why its a 6 from me. On the technicals: the exposure on the drop is very nice, but the fish is a bit soft.  My guess is the fish might be a picture on a computer monitor behind the drop?', '2007-06-02 11:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728414, 518270, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice movement on the mill.  Background is nice, but don''t like the crop on the bottom -- cuts the interesting clouds off and makes the windmill look a little crooked.  6</td>', 'Nice movement on the mill.  Background is nice, but don''t like the crop on the bottom -- cuts the interesting clouds off and makes the windmill look a little crooked.  6', '2007-06-02 11:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728424, 521503, 70270, '<td valign="top">LOL - definitely an out of the box approach to the challenge.  Nice composition and processing.</td>', 'LOL - definitely an out of the box approach to the challenge.  Nice composition and processing.', '2007-06-02 11:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728447, 521727, 70270, '<td valign="top">Hey, its contre jour again!  Nice job - good subject and nice bw conversion.</td>', 'Hey, its contre jour again!  Nice job - good subject and nice bw conversion.', '2007-06-02 11:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728452, 521697, 70270, '<td valign="top">Interesting landscape and clouds, but the two compete for my interest.  Nice shot, but nothing here that makes me want to linger.  6</td>', 'Interesting landscape and clouds, but the two compete for my interest.  Nice shot, but nothing here that makes me want to linger.  6', '2007-06-02 11:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728457, 522358, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice color and composition, and nice cloud-sky-cloud diagonal pattern.  Clouds are a bit soft on the upper right, tho.</td>', 'Nice color and composition, and nice cloud-sky-cloud diagonal pattern.  Clouds are a bit soft on the upper right, tho.', '2007-06-02 11:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728462, 520862, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection shot, but not particularly interesting.  Well composed, good sharpness, and its got one of the elements in there as a strong feature, so you get a 6 from me.</td>', 'Nice reflection shot, but not particularly interesting.  Well composed, good sharpness, and its got one of the elements in there as a strong feature, so you get a 6 from me.', '2007-06-02 11:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728468, 521410, 70270, '<td valign="top">nice composition; love the blue feel to the pic.  A bit soft on the focus, and perhaps a tad overexposed on the falls</td>', 'nice composition; love the blue feel to the pic.  A bit soft on the focus, and perhaps a tad overexposed on the falls', '2007-06-02 11:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728473, 522330, 70270, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  I like the use of BW here, and the frame you used.  Vineyards are surprisingly difficult to shoot ... lots of competing lines between the vines, wire supports, and rows to contend with.  But you''ve done a nice job here. Bumping you up to a 7</td>', 'This is very nice.  I like the use of BW here, and the frame you used.  Vineyards are surprisingly difficult to shoot ... lots of competing lines between the vines, wire supports, and rows to contend with.  But you''ve done a nice job here. Bumping you up to a 7', '2007-06-02 11:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728477, 521485, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but doesn''t hold my attention very long.  Watering can is a little soft.  Exposure on the plant and water is nice.  6</td>', 'Nice shot, but doesn''t hold my attention very long.  Watering can is a little soft.  Exposure on the plant and water is nice.  6', '2007-06-02 11:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728479, 522209, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good bokeh ... these are tough to pop from the background.  Not much earth, wind or water in the shot, but still nice.  6</td>', 'Good bokeh ... these are tough to pop from the background.  Not much earth, wind or water in the shot, but still nice.  6', '2007-06-02 11:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728489, 520323, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice scene .. falls on the left look a little washed out.  6</td>', 'Nice scene .. falls on the left look a little washed out.  6', '2007-06-02 11:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728495, 522019, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice illustration, if a bit overdone in the DPC style.  Technically nice, but not a lot of depth or emotion in the image for me.  6</td>', 'Nice illustration, if a bit overdone in the DPC style.  Technically nice, but not a lot of depth or emotion in the image for me.  6', '2007-06-02 11:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728501, 521666, 70270, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, nicely carried off.  Would a contrasting element, like water, have worked in place of the rocks?  Just a thought.  6</td>', 'Interesting idea, nicely carried off.  Would a contrasting element, like water, have worked in place of the rocks?  Just a thought.  6', '2007-06-02 11:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728503, 521830, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, love the colors and tones but the droplets are kind of lost against the yellow background.  6</td>', 'Nice shot, love the colors and tones but the droplets are kind of lost against the yellow background.  6', '2007-06-02 11:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728504, 521795, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the blurred reeds in the foreground that help frame the image.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the blurred reeds in the foreground that help frame the image.', '2007-06-02 11:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728515, 520459, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure, good subject for the challenge.</td>', 'Nice exposure, good subject for the challenge.', '2007-06-02 11:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728517, 521257, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but focus is a little soft.</td>', 'Nice idea, but focus is a little soft.', '2007-06-02 11:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728522, 520124, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, and the exposure on the water being poured is nice, but the overall composition is kind of boring -- perhaps a more interesting looking glass would have helped.</td>', 'Nice colors, and the exposure on the water being poured is nice, but the overall composition is kind of boring -- perhaps a more interesting looking glass would have helped.', '2007-06-02 11:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728528, 522285, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice BW conversion, but no strong subject for the image.  The flowers on the sides of the path are too jumbled together to provide a clear subject to look at, but because there''s so much going on there it distracts the eye from your main subject</td>', 'Nice BW conversion, but no strong subject for the image.  The flowers on the sides of the path are too jumbled together to provide a clear subject to look at, but because there''s so much going on there it distracts the eye from your main subject', '2007-06-02 11:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728757, 521929, 78389, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2007-06-02 13:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728840, 521818, 48227, '<td valign="top">Love it. Great clarity and contrast. 10</td>', 'Love it. Great clarity and contrast. 10', '2007-06-02 13:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728848, 520989, 48227, '<td valign="top">Excellent, sky is fantastic. 10</td>', 'Excellent, sky is fantastic. 10', '2007-06-02 13:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728853, 521024, 48227, '<td valign="top">Great composition, and clarity is amazing. Good luck. 10</td>', 'Great composition, and clarity is amazing. Good luck. 10', '2007-06-02 13:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728905, 521666, 53062, '<td valign="top">Nice idea..</td>', 'Nice idea..', '2007-06-02 14:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728993, 520815, 55621, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, it seems slightly soft on the focus.</td>', 'Interesting image, it seems slightly soft on the focus.', '2007-06-02 14:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729001, 522077, 70270, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but i would have liked this better with only one branch -- the two crossing branches are distracting, and the focus is a bit soft on the caterpillar.  5</td>', 'nice idea, but i would have liked this better with only one branch -- the two crossing branches are distracting, and the focus is a bit soft on the caterpillar.  5', '2007-06-02 14:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729010, 520325, 70270, '<td valign="top">I love the reflection in the water, and would have liked to have seen the frame move down a bit to capture the whole reflection and less of the empty space at the top.</td>', 'I love the reflection in the water, and would have liked to have seen the frame move down a bit to capture the whole reflection and less of the empty space at the top.', '2007-06-02 14:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729016, 522081, 70270, '<td valign="top">Difficult to distinguish between the water and the glass with the processing you''ve used here.  Nice BW conversion with deep rich black tones</td>', 'Difficult to distinguish between the water and the glass with the processing you''ve used here.  Nice BW conversion with deep rich black tones', '2007-06-02 14:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729017, 520219, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but focus is too soft on the boat.  5</td>', 'Nice composition, but focus is too soft on the boat.  5', '2007-06-02 14:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729022, 521271, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections on the water, though I would have liked to see the horizon line on the top third rather than in the middle.  Not the strongest connection to the challenge topic, but technically within the subject.  5</td>', 'Nice reflections on the water, though I would have liked to see the horizon line on the top third rather than in the middle.  Not the strongest connection to the challenge topic, but technically within the subject.  5', '2007-06-02 14:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729026, 520357, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, but lacks visual interest.  A bird or person on that rock jutting into the water would make this really pop.  5</td>', 'Nice scene, but lacks visual interest.  A bird or person on that rock jutting into the water would make this really pop.  5', '2007-06-02 14:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729041, 519793, 70270, '<td valign="top">GREAT idea!  Actually, I shot this same thing (4 elements in 4 glasses) but didn''t enter it because I wasn''t happy with the result, so I know how difficult this shot was to set up.  The glasses in this composition are just ordinary wine glasses, and I think that brings the image down and prevents it from popping.  The flame and the earth are both kind of blurred by the glass as well.  The water is my favorite ... nicely lit and well exposed.  All in all I ended up giving you a 5 -- some good things, some could be improved, and an average result.</td>', 'GREAT idea!  Actually, I shot this same thing (4 elements in 4 glasses) but didn''t enter it because I wasn''t happy with the result, so I know how difficult this shot was to set up.  The glasses in this composition are just ordinary wine glasses, and I think that brings the image down and prevents it from popping.  The flame and the earth are both kind of blurred by the glass as well.  The water is my favorite ... nicely lit and well exposed.  All in all I ended up giving you a 5 -- some good things, some could be improved, and an average result.', '2007-06-02 14:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729051, 522246, 70270, '<td valign="top">I had a hard time getting this image ... the color on the water is too silver after the BW conversion, lending a strange overall appearance to the photo, and no strong point of interest to grab my attention.  4</td>', 'I had a hard time getting this image ... the color on the water is too silver after the BW conversion, lending a strange overall appearance to the photo, and no strong point of interest to grab my attention.  4', '2007-06-02 14:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729056, 522053, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, but kind of bland.  A strong point of interest in the foreground -- bush, tree, animal -- would help, as would moving the horizon line upp or down -- the beautiful colors in the scene compete for attention with the interesting sky.  5</td>', 'Nice scene, but kind of bland.  A strong point of interest in the foreground -- bush, tree, animal -- would help, as would moving the horizon line upp or down -- the beautiful colors in the scene compete for attention with the interesting sky.  5', '2007-06-02 14:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729062, 519457, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I''ve seen it one too many times in recent challenges -- that brings it down a bit for me, and prevents it from really popping.  As compared with the other recent shots (which may or may not be yours), I don''t think this is as good because there''s not great definition between the trees or as interesting lines and forms to carry the composition -- this one is all about the processing technique, and that alone isn''t enough to carry the day for me.  5.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I''ve seen it one too many times in recent challenges -- that brings it down a bit for me, and prevents it from really popping.  As compared with the other recent shots (which may or may not be yours), I don''t think this is as good because there''s not great definition between the trees or as interesting lines and forms to carry the composition -- this one is all about the processing technique, and that alone isn''t enough to carry the day for me.  5.', '2007-06-02 14:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729072, 521530, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, but the angle is uninteresting.  Shooting from beach level rather than the bluffs above (if access was available) would improve this a lot.  Focus is a bit soft, and you''ve lost some detail in the rocks there.  Try boosting the exposure to bring out more detail -- in-camera meters always seems to underexpose scenes like this because of the amount of light reflecting off the water.  4</td>', 'Nice scene, but the angle is uninteresting.  Shooting from beach level rather than the bluffs above (if access was available) would improve this a lot.  Focus is a bit soft, and you''ve lost some detail in the rocks there.  Try boosting the exposure to bring out more detail -- in-camera meters always seems to underexpose scenes like this because of the amount of light reflecting off the water.  4', '2007-06-02 14:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729076, 520120, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, but not enough interest in the water to carry the image, and seems a bit too contrasty for my taste.  4</td>', 'Nice scene, but not enough interest in the water to carry the image, and seems a bit too contrasty for my taste.  4', '2007-06-02 14:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729077, 521902, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good idea and rich tones.  The composition pulls this down for me ... with the horizon line where it is, the sky competes too much with the sand for attention, and there''s nothing up there but the color to hold my interest.  I would have liked this better with a lower angle, even lying on the ground, looking straight up one of the wind furrow, with  a smaller ribbon of sky at the top.  5</td>', 'Good idea and rich tones.  The composition pulls this down for me ... with the horizon line where it is, the sky competes too much with the sand for attention, and there''s nothing up there but the color to hold my interest.  I would have liked this better with a lower angle, even lying on the ground, looking straight up one of the wind furrow, with  a smaller ribbon of sky at the top.  5', '2007-06-02 14:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729081, 522278, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but there''s no wow factor for me here since this kind of image is done to death on DPC.  I originally gave you a 5, but on second look I can''t really justify that compared to the competition so bumping you up to a 6</td>', 'Nice shot, but there''s no wow factor for me here since this kind of image is done to death on DPC.  I originally gave you a 5, but on second look I can''t really justify that compared to the competition so bumping you up to a 6', '2007-06-02 14:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729083, 518776, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the lighting is not good ... too many hot spots on the glass, the background is too dark, and the spilling water gets lots.  4</td>', 'Good idea, but the lighting is not good ... too many hot spots on the glass, the background is too dark, and the spilling water gets lots.  4', '2007-06-02 14:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729089, 520839, 70270, '<td valign="top">Ordinary shot of a boring subject, but nothing to evoke any kind of reaction from the viewer.  Flame is a bit overexposed.  Your technicals are good.  Try to find more interesting subjects to work with.  5</td>', 'Ordinary shot of a boring subject, but nothing to evoke any kind of reaction from the viewer.  Flame is a bit overexposed.  Your technicals are good.  Try to find more interesting subjects to work with.  5', '2007-06-02 14:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729095, 521592, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset scene, strange title.  Nothing that makes it pop above the ordinary -- just a pretty ordinary pretty picture.  5</td>', 'Nice sunset scene, strange title.  Nothing that makes it pop above the ordinary -- just a pretty ordinary pretty picture.  5', '2007-06-02 14:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729098, 522107, 70270, '<td valign="top">Oh this is nicer than I thought.  First view was a 5.  But second time through I like the way you''ve composed this, with three windmills facing one way set off by the fourth facing opposite, and a nice exposure on the sky.  Would have liked to see more detail in the foreground or a stronger fade to black, but this is still nice.  Bumping up to a 6</td>', 'Oh this is nicer than I thought.  First view was a 5.  But second time through I like the way you''ve composed this, with three windmills facing one way set off by the fourth facing opposite, and a nice exposure on the sky.  Would have liked to see more detail in the foreground or a stronger fade to black, but this is still nice.  Bumping up to a 6', '2007-06-02 14:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729099, 521819, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but a bit oversharpened or oversaturated?</td>', 'Nice shot, but a bit oversharpened or oversaturated?', '2007-06-02 14:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729106, 522342, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure and sharpness, but too blurry on la terre.  I keep looking at the one piece of dirt expecting to see the snail, before realizing that''s just the dirt.  5</td>', 'Nice exposure and sharpness, but too blurry on la terre.  I keep looking at the one piece of dirt expecting to see the snail, before realizing that''s just the dirt.  5', '2007-06-02 14:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729110, 521627, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and good timing, but the power lines and yellow lights ruin this for me.  5</td>', 'Nice capture and good timing, but the power lines and yellow lights ruin this for me.  5', '2007-06-02 15:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729113, 521301, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but not enough visual interest to carry the day.  More interesting looking containers and a lower angle would have helped.  5</td>', 'Nice idea, but not enough visual interest to carry the day.  More interesting looking containers and a lower angle would have helped.  5', '2007-06-02 15:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729117, 521051, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but needed to be sharper in the foreground -- don''t mind the shallow DOF at the end of the track, but those first three tread marks out of focus are really distracting.  5</td>', 'Good idea, but needed to be sharper in the foreground -- don''t mind the shallow DOF at the end of the track, but those first three tread marks out of focus are really distracting.  5', '2007-06-02 15:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729119, 522166, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but background has too many lines and drops that distract from the main subject.</td>', 'Good idea, but background has too many lines and drops that distract from the main subject.', '2007-06-02 15:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729126, 520971, 70270, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too harsh, and the subject is not original.  The hands compete with the flower for attention -- would have been better shooting from the front or straight down.  Just a 4 from me.</td>', 'Lighting is too harsh, and the subject is not original.  The hands compete with the flower for attention -- would have been better shooting from the front or straight down.  Just a 4 from me.', '2007-06-02 15:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729131, 521038, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure, and I like the echo of the fountain in the flagpole.  Missed that little touch the first time through, so bumping you up to a 6 on the second pass.</td>', 'Nice exposure, and I like the echo of the fountain in the flagpole.  Missed that little touch the first time through, so bumping you up to a 6 on the second pass.', '2007-06-02 15:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729133, 520489, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice textures on the water, and I think the out of focus rower works here.  Didn''t wow me the first time through, but bumping you up to a 6 on the second pass</td>', 'Nice textures on the water, and I think the out of focus rower works here.  Didn''t wow me the first time through, but bumping you up to a 6 on the second pass', '2007-06-02 15:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729139, 521871, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but subject is not original (so loses any chance at a wow factor from me), and water pouring down is not blurry enough to show motion and ends up distracting me. Nice exposure on the water and ice in the glass, and like the bubbles too.  Some pluses and some minuses add up to a 5 from me.</td>', 'Nice colors, but subject is not original (so loses any chance at a wow factor from me), and water pouring down is not blurry enough to show motion and ends up distracting me. Nice exposure on the water and ice in the glass, and like the bubbles too.  Some pluses and some minuses add up to a 5 from me.', '2007-06-02 15:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729141, 519851, 70270, '<td valign="top">The fire is nice, but the hand and the overall composition are not that interesting.</td>', 'The fire is nice, but the hand and the overall composition are not that interesting.', '2007-06-02 15:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729145, 522016, 55621, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but it seems a little flat.</td>', 'Nice photo but it seems a little flat.', '2007-06-02 15:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729149, 520999, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the tones are little flat (muddy?) and the picture kind of uninteresting.  Getting in closer to the treads or really going for a strong detail shot would have been better than trying to get the whole tractor tread in.  5 for the effort and the vision -- need to work your subject a little harder next time.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the tones are little flat (muddy?) and the picture kind of uninteresting.  Getting in closer to the treads or really going for a strong detail shot would have been better than trying to get the whole tractor tread in.  5 for the effort and the vision -- need to work your subject a little harder next time.', '2007-06-02 15:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729151, 521904, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, though would have liked to see some more DOF.</td>', 'Nice macro, though would have liked to see some more DOF.', '2007-06-02 15:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729152, 522151, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but the subjects -- sky, lighthouse, boat/water -- compete with one another.  Perhaps cropping the left side closer to the tower wold help.</td>', 'Nice picture, but the subjects -- sky, lighthouse, boat/water -- compete with one another.  Perhaps cropping the left side closer to the tower wold help.', '2007-06-02 15:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729153, 522018, 55621, '<td valign="top">If you had been closer on the drop, your attention is directed there but it doesn''t hold you very long.</td>', 'If you had been closer on the drop, your attention is directed there but it doesn''t hold you very long.', '2007-06-02 15:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729154, 522288, 70270, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but has the feel of a quick snapshot.  Lighting is flat, and there''s not much here to hold your interest. 4</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but has the feel of a quick snapshot.  Lighting is flat, and there''s not much here to hold your interest. 4', '2007-06-02 15:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729158, 522136, 55621, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, sky needs a little more punch.</td>', 'Interesting idea, sky needs a little more punch.', '2007-06-02 15:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729160, 521769, 55621, '<td valign="top">I see the rowers, I don''t see their reflections</td>', 'I see the rowers, I don''t see their reflections', '2007-06-02 15:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729162, 520141, 70270, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t hold my interest very long ... the cut off rails and docks at the top of the frame hurt the image, and there''s nothing of interest in the water to carry the day.  Now if the composition was moved up to include the walkway behind the boats, and there just happened to be someone walking by with an umbrella, or a boatsman in a yellow rain slicker, that would have provided some interest to the shot -- as it is, what you have here is a potentially nice background to a subject that''s missing from the photo.  4</td>', 'Doesn''t hold my interest very long ... the cut off rails and docks at the top of the frame hurt the image, and there''s nothing of interest in the water to carry the day.  Now if the composition was moved up to include the walkway behind the boats, and there just happened to be someone walking by with an umbrella, or a boatsman in a yellow rain slicker, that would have provided some interest to the shot -- as it is, what you have here is a potentially nice background to a subject that''s missing from the photo.  4', '2007-06-02 15:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729164, 519906, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice try, but the flames aren''t enough to hold my interest very long.  4</td>', 'Nice try, but the flames aren''t enough to hold my interest very long.  4', '2007-06-02 15:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729167, 522218, 55621, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, there is a lot of negative space on the bottom, maybe a tighter crop.</td>', 'Nice shot, there is a lot of negative space on the bottom, maybe a tighter crop.', '2007-06-02 15:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729171, 521491, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice try at an abstract, but this one just doesn''t work for me.  4.</td>', 'Nice try at an abstract, but this one just doesn''t work for me.  4.', '2007-06-02 15:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729173, 522362, 70270, '<td valign="top">Not a strong enough tie to the challenge for me, but a nice enough picture of a happy guy playing in the water.  4</td>', 'Not a strong enough tie to the challenge for me, but a nice enough picture of a happy guy playing in the water.  4', '2007-06-02 15:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729174, 520910, 70270, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but the picture doesn''t do much for me.  Originally a 4, I''ll bump you to a 5 for creativity.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but the picture doesn''t do much for me.  Originally a 4, I''ll bump you to a 5 for creativity.', '2007-06-02 15:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729178, 521889, 55621, '<td valign="top">If you had been up 5 or 6 feet on a ladder you could have gotten more water and less grass.</td>', 'If you had been up 5 or 6 feet on a ladder you could have gotten more water and less grass.', '2007-06-02 15:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729181, 522290, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nothing here that meets the challenge in any way for me.  The picture is kind of interesting though.  Coming a bit lower to include her entire necklace, even if you cut off a bit of the top of her head, might have been better.</td>', 'Nothing here that meets the challenge in any way for me.  The picture is kind of interesting though.  Coming a bit lower to include her entire necklace, even if you cut off a bit of the top of her head, might have been better.', '2007-06-02 15:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729182, 522077, 55621, '<td valign="top">Caterpillar is to dark and gets lost in your message.</td>', 'Caterpillar is to dark and gets lost in your message.', '2007-06-02 15:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729185, 522278, 55621, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, look like a comb for pyromaniacs.</td>', 'Cool shot, look like a comb for pyromaniacs.', '2007-06-02 15:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729188, 520844, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but without seeing anything of his face it lacks interest.  Even a profile in shadow would have helped.  My original reaction was a 4, but bumping to a 5.</td>', 'Nice idea, but without seeing anything of his face it lacks interest.  Even a profile in shadow would have helped.  My original reaction was a 4, but bumping to a 5.', '2007-06-02 15:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729190, 521794, 55621, '<td valign="top">This would have been an amazing photo if it weren''t for the bright spot between the legs of the H.</td>', 'This would have been an amazing photo if it weren''t for the bright spot between the legs of the H.', '2007-06-02 15:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729195, 522062, 70270, '<td valign="top">Ordinary snapshot here ... nothing unique or creative to grab my attention here.  Doesn''t have the feel of an image that had a lot of thought put into it either beforehand, or while out trying to capture the subject.  4</td>', 'Ordinary snapshot here ... nothing unique or creative to grab my attention here.  Doesn''t have the feel of an image that had a lot of thought put into it either beforehand, or while out trying to capture the subject.  4', '2007-06-02 15:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729196, 521608, 55621, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell what''s being photographed.  Not a lot of detail, pretty sky.</td>', 'It''s hard to tell what''s being photographed.  Not a lot of detail, pretty sky.', '2007-06-02 15:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3729202, 521567, 70270, '<td valign="top">Interesting subjec,t but the tonal range is off -- shadows lack detail and some of the highlights in the fire are blown out.</td>', 'Interesting subjec,t but the tonal range is off -- shadows lack detail and some of the highlights in the fire are blown out.', '2007-06-02 15:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
