(3730534, 519849, 52130, '<td valign="top">ribboner</td>', 'ribboner', '2007-06-03 00:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730561, 521794, 52130, '<td valign="top">ummm...ok, I''ll just ask...why red???<br/>looks like you applied a solarize filter. cool idea, strange result</td>', 'ummm...ok, I''ll just ask...why red???looks like you applied a solarize filter. cool idea, strange result', '2007-06-03 00:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730619, 521901, 77243, '<td valign="top">Very abstract, nicely done.</td>', 'Very abstract, nicely done.', '2007-06-03 00:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730656, 521301, 7485, '<td valign="top">Clever!</td>', 'Clever!', '2007-06-03 00:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730675, 520369, 7485, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept, and I particularly like the clay Earth</td>', 'Excellent concept, and I particularly like the clay Earth', '2007-06-03 00:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730704, 521660, 76430, '<td valign="top">Intense eyes and great texture.  I''ll be interested to see how you did this one.  Great picture, but the only problem is I don''t see the four elements.  I even looked up Golem in Wikipedia and didn''t see a match there, other than maybe earth, though I found out it isn''t something from Lord of the Rings.  Despite that I am giving it one of my higher scores based on the uniqueness of it.</td>', 'Intense eyes and great texture.  I''ll be interested to see how you did this one.  Great picture, but the only problem is I don''t see the four elements.  I even looked up Golem in Wikipedia and didn''t see a match there, other than maybe earth, though I found out it isn''t something from Lord of the Rings.  Despite that I am giving it one of my higher scores based on the uniqueness of it.', '2007-06-03 01:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730708, 522351, 76430, '<td valign="top">You have fire here.  It seems very out of focus.</td>', 'You have fire here.  It seems very out of focus.', '2007-06-03 01:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730732, 519237, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  Good deep DOF.  Nice smooth water flow from long exposure.</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  Good deep DOF.  Nice smooth water flow from long exposure.', '2007-06-03 01:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730739, 520432, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  I''m assuming the drop is much closer to the camera than the goldfish, so excellent DOF.  I love the colors.</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  I''m assuming the drop is much closer to the camera than the goldfish, so excellent DOF.  I love the colors.', '2007-06-03 01:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730748, 521795, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture and DOF.  Very appropriate and good lighting.  It''s got a mysterious feel to it.  You really have all 4 elements here, with the obvious earth and water, along with the air pointed out with the mist and the fire from the rising sun.</td>', 'Very nice picture and DOF.  Very appropriate and good lighting.  It''s got a mysterious feel to it.  You really have all 4 elements here, with the obvious earth and water, along with the air pointed out with the mist and the fire from the rising sun.', '2007-06-03 01:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730770, 519850, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture looks like a poster.  All the elements are present.  Nice stop-motion on the waves.  One of the best so far.</td>', 'Beautiful picture looks like a poster.  All the elements are present.  Nice stop-motion on the waves.  One of the best so far.', '2007-06-03 01:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730807, 521340, 69487, '<td valign="top">Come on wheres the 5th LMAO.... sorry hopefully you know what im talking about!</td>', 'Come on wheres the 5th LMAO.... sorry hopefully you know what im talking about!', '2007-06-03 01:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730847, 519851, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very well done and highly impressive capture.</td>', 'Very well done and highly impressive capture.', '2007-06-03 01:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730853, 522289, 74371, '<td valign="top">Neat shot!! I am usually a devout follower of the "thirds" rule, but in this instance...the balance is perfect, the focus is right on. Great job!</td>', 'Neat shot!! I am usually a devout follower of the "thirds" rule, but in this instance...the balance is perfect, the focus is right on. Great job!', '2007-06-03 01:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730862, 520993, 74371, '<td valign="top">Exquisite!!  This is a perfect picture. Focus is dead on, and the alignment is great.I love all of the intricateness of the leaf''s grain. Excellent photo!!  <br/>(9)</td>', 'Exquisite!!  This is a perfect picture. Focus is dead on, and the alignment is great.I love all of the intricateness of the leaf''s grain. Excellent photo!!  (9)', '2007-06-03 02:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730876, 522081, 74371, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Great focusing, and I love the ''all shook up'' feel to it. Took some good thinking to come up with this.  (8)</td>', 'Great shot! Great focusing, and I love the ''all shook up'' feel to it. Took some good thinking to come up with this.  (8)', '2007-06-03 02:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730877, 521839, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful coloring with the saturating of the moss and reds of the earth.</td>', 'Beautiful coloring with the saturating of the moss and reds of the earth.', '2007-06-03 02:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730882, 521174, 74371, '<td valign="top">Love how you made sure the "shy" moon was in there. Well set up photo, and clearly focused. I would like to see the fisher''person''s clothing colors a little crisper</td>', 'Love how you made sure the "shy" moon was in there. Well set up photo, and clearly focused. I would like to see the fisher''person''s clothing colors a little crisper', '2007-06-03 02:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730886, 521675, 74371, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to read how you did this one!  Nicely thought out... and I suppose it is also well executed. ;)  (7)</td>', 'Can''t wait to read how you did this one!  Nicely thought out... and I suppose it is also well executed. ;)  (7)', '2007-06-03 02:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730889, 522048, 74371, '<td valign="top">Nice!!! Well set up and planned out.</td>', 'Nice!!! Well set up and planned out.', '2007-06-03 02:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730893, 521054, 74371, '<td valign="top">Well balanced, sharply focused and crisp colors! Great photo!</td>', 'Well balanced, sharply focused and crisp colors! Great photo!', '2007-06-03 02:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730899, 521024, 76430, '<td valign="top">Excellent sharpness and beautiful colors.  Great POV.  Iceland?</td>', 'Excellent sharpness and beautiful colors.  Great POV.  Iceland?', '2007-06-03 02:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730907, 521399, 74371, '<td valign="top">A little too dark for me in the lower parts of the photo and, since the title infers "wind rain and lightening", shouldn''t we see some evidence of at least one part of it? Sorry... I hate being petty, but other than being a nice example of some architecture, the picture, to me, does not exemplify anything that should be here.  (4)</td>', 'A little too dark for me in the lower parts of the photo and, since the title infers "wind rain and lightening", shouldn''t we see some evidence of at least one part of it? Sorry... I hate being petty, but other than being a nice example of some architecture, the picture, to me, does not exemplify anything that should be here.  (4)', '2007-06-03 02:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730913, 521976, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful vantage point.  Very nice sharpness.</td>', 'Beautiful vantage point.  Very nice sharpness.', '2007-06-03 02:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730915, 520372, 74371, '<td valign="top">I love infra-red photos...and trees are always the most stunning. Almost thought this was a form of solarization, but it is too even and the trees are the only thing intensely affected.  Good job!! (7)</td>', 'I love infra-red photos...and trees are always the most stunning. Almost thought this was a form of solarization, but it is too even and the trees are the only thing intensely affected.  Good job!! (7)', '2007-06-03 02:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730918, 522278, 74371, '<td valign="top">I like the whole aspect of this shot. Well focused and the alignment makes the picture. Good job!</td>', 'I like the whole aspect of this shot. Well focused and the alignment makes the picture. Good job!', '2007-06-03 02:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730922, 519457, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  Infrared filter?  Nice nearly mirror image.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  Infrared filter?  Nice nearly mirror image.', '2007-06-03 02:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730924, 521467, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice worlds of flowers refracted within the drops</td>', 'Nice worlds of flowers refracted within the drops', '2007-06-03 02:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3730957, 521915, 76430, '<td valign="top">Great feeling of depth in the picture.  Good sharpness.  Orange and yellow lighthouse (post-processing?) really stands out indicating the fire, right next to the sunlight coming through the clouds.  I love this picture.  One of my first 10 votes.</td>', 'Great feeling of depth in the picture.  Good sharpness.  Orange and yellow lighthouse (post-processing?) really stands out indicating the fire, right next to the sunlight coming through the clouds.  I love this picture.  One of my first 10 votes.', '2007-06-03 03:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3731034, 520432, 79242, '<td valign="top">Elementally the best of the bunch. Captures the idea of the competition well and is a great photo. I love the simplicity.</td>', 'Elementally the best of the bunch. Captures the idea of the competition well and is a great photo. I love the simplicity.', '2007-06-03 05:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3731035, 522048, 79242, '<td valign="top">Great Photo. IMO the second best photo in the class and my only 9.</td>', 'Great Photo. IMO the second best photo in the class and my only 9.', '2007-06-03 05:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3731036, 522250, 79242, '<td valign="top">One of the best int he group. 8</td>', 'One of the best int he group. 8', '2007-06-03 05:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3731037, 521024, 79242, '<td valign="top">Great color, but I see a little noise. Still one of the best in the bunch 8</td>', 'Great color, but I see a little noise. Still one of the best in the bunch 8', '2007-06-03 05:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3731038, 520834, 79242, '<td valign="top">A good overall picture of fireworks, but I rated it a little high because it fit well in the elements theme. Normally a 7, but for this category an 8.</td>', 'A good overall picture of fireworks, but I rated it a little high because it fit well in the elements theme. Normally a 7, but for this category an 8.', '2007-06-03 05:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3731039, 521727, 79242, '<td valign="top">Good photo. I like the placement of the sun. 8</td>', 'Good photo. I like the placement of the sun. 8', '2007-06-03 05:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3731040, 521485, 79242, '<td valign="top">Simple and clean. I love the color and it is "elementally" wonderful. 8</td>', 'Simple and clean. I love the color and it is "elementally" wonderful. 8', '2007-06-03 05:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3731042, 522356, 79242, '<td valign="top">Great contrast of color. 8</td>', 'Great contrast of color. 8', '2007-06-03 05:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3731043, 519658, 79242, '<td valign="top">Well done. Several photos witht his same theme, but this was the best of the bunch. 8</td>', 'Well done. Several photos witht his same theme, but this was the best of the bunch. 8', '2007-06-03 05:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3731044, 521467, 79242, '<td valign="top">The bottom dew drop with the sun sparkling in it is what I think makes this better than the other photos of the same concept... 8</td>', 'The bottom dew drop with the sun sparkling in it is what I think makes this better than the other photos of the same concept... 8', '2007-06-03 05:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3731047, 522285, 79242, '<td valign="top">Simple, dirty and wonderful. Proving that you can make great photographs of almost anything. 8</td>', 'Simple, dirty and wonderful. Proving that you can make great photographs of almost anything. 8', '2007-06-03 05:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3731050, 520815, 79242, '<td valign="top">IMO the best "Water drop" photo... 8</td>', 'IMO the best "Water drop" photo... 8', '2007-06-03 05:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3731051, 522052, 79242, '<td valign="top">Very good. gets an 8 from me</td>', 'Very good. gets an 8 from me', '2007-06-03 05:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
