(3733230, 522048, 47852, '<td valign="top">I usually vote in the middle range the first time through, and then adjust my votes on round two... rarely do I find a shot that I like so much that it gets an automatic 10, but this is just stunning!  The wet dirt, water droplets on the leaves, the slight movement of the rain, and the bright red umbrella are all perfect, and the dof is right on.  I''m sure this was completely set up, and someone is probably holding a watering can over this little plant, but who cares.  Wonderful job!</td>', 'I usually vote in the middle range the first time through, and then adjust my votes on round two... rarely do I find a shot that I like so much that it gets an automatic 10, but this is just stunning!  The wet dirt, water droplets on the leaves, the slight movement of the rain, and the bright red umbrella are all perfect, and the dof is right on.  I''m sure this was completely set up, and someone is probably holding a watering can over this little plant, but who cares.  Wonderful job!', '2007-06-03 18:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
