(3734557, 520545, 73601, '<td valign="top">great idea, well executed</td>', 'great idea, well executed', '2007-06-04 00:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734559, 521996, 20324, '<td valign="top">Great colors and nice composition. It is a good "natural abstract" picture.</td>', 'Great colors and nice composition. It is a good "natural abstract" picture.', '2007-06-04 00:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734561, 521359, 73601, '<td valign="top">excellent composition, dramatic sky, slight vignetting works well here</td>', 'excellent composition, dramatic sky, slight vignetting works well here', '2007-06-04 00:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734566, 520373, 63244, '<td valign="top">The contrasting colors are beautiful.  I really like this composition. There is a very slight halo around the earth, but maybe this was intentional. It is a little distracting to me.  Great, creative photo!8</td>', 'The contrasting colors are beautiful.  I really like this composition. There is a very slight halo around the earth, but maybe this was intentional. It is a little distracting to me.  Great, creative photo!8', '2007-06-04 00:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734568, 521412, 73601, '<td valign="top">the exposure for the water is perfect, nicely done</td>', 'the exposure for the water is perfect, nicely done', '2007-06-04 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734569, 520846, 20324, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective, good color and contrast.</td>', 'Simple but effective, good color and contrast.', '2007-06-04 00:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734574, 520696, 73601, '<td valign="top">great colors, use of light is fab, reflection is wonderful</td>', 'great colors, use of light is fab, reflection is wonderful', '2007-06-04 00:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734580, 521978, 67834, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but i''m guessing this has been processed in Photoshop as it looks really oversharpened, and it almost looks like the people have been cut and pasted into this scene which may well be the case? It just doesn''t fit for me and looks unbalanced. <br/>I do like the bold colours on the kite and the expression on the girls face :o) 5</td>', 'I like the idea but i''m guessing this has been processed in Photoshop as it looks really oversharpened, and it almost looks like the people have been cut and pasted into this scene which may well be the case? It just doesn''t fit for me and looks unbalanced. I do like the bold colours on the kite and the expression on the girls face :o) 5', '2007-06-04 00:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734585, 521499, 63244, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but the shiny granite is distracting. Composition, colors and lighting are great. Focus is spot on!</td>', 'I like the photo, but the shiny granite is distracting. Composition, colors and lighting are great. Focus is spot on!', '2007-06-04 00:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734592, 522338, 20324, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective, interesting composition. It works for me.</td>', 'Cool perspective, interesting composition. It works for me.', '2007-06-04 00:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734595, 519278, 63244, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit too bright.  Nice composition.</td>', 'This looks a bit too bright.  Nice composition.', '2007-06-04 00:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734606, 521539, 53690, '<td valign="top">This isn''t just a landscape, I really think it portrays earth well.  Lovely colors, I like the subtle green in the background and beginning to sprout in the foreground.</td>', 'This isn''t just a landscape, I really think it portrays earth well.  Lovely colors, I like the subtle green in the background and beginning to sprout in the foreground.', '2007-06-04 00:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734609, 521405, 53690, '<td valign="top">Ooo, pretty!  Sorry, that''s my first reaction.  I really love the colors here, and all the white is really nice.  The gradient in the sky is lovely; it works really well in this shot.</td>', 'Ooo, pretty!  Sorry, that''s my first reaction.  I really love the colors here, and all the white is really nice.  The gradient in the sky is lovely; it works really well in this shot.', '2007-06-04 00:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734611, 520372, 20324, '<td valign="top">Nice sepia tone here. It works well with this IR photo.</td>', 'Nice sepia tone here. It works well with this IR photo.', '2007-06-04 00:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734615, 519593, 53690, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I love the colors in the sky, and especially in the reflection of the sky.  It truly looks like a fire brewing in there.  Nice placement of the horizon on the thirds.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I love the colors in the sky, and especially in the reflection of the sky.  It truly looks like a fire brewing in there.  Nice placement of the horizon on the thirds.', '2007-06-04 00:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734619, 521915, 53690, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I love the blues of the water, and the layers of clouds in the sky.  The rocks look great too.  I can''t decide if I like the light house or not (not that you really had a choice on that).</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I love the blues of the water, and the layers of clouds in the sky.  The rocks look great too.  I can''t decide if I like the light house or not (not that you really had a choice on that).', '2007-06-04 00:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734620, 521535, 73601, '<td valign="top">great focal range, love the brick and the green, very interesting image</td>', 'great focal range, love the brick and the green, very interesting image', '2007-06-04 00:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734621, 521914, 53690, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful.  The sharpness is nice, and I like the bit of green in the lower left.  It adds some good color to the shot.</td>', 'Really beautiful.  The sharpness is nice, and I like the bit of green in the lower left.  It adds some good color to the shot.', '2007-06-04 00:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734623, 521485, 53690, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  I think it''s well-executed too.</td>', 'Cool idea.  I think it''s well-executed too.', '2007-06-04 00:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734625, 520313, 53690, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Great idea, and I''m sure it took some time/experimenting to get the timing right on this one.  I do wish the matches were all straight, but I realize that could be a lot harder than it looks.</td>', 'Very cool.  Great idea, and I''m sure it took some time/experimenting to get the timing right on this one.  I do wish the matches were all straight, but I realize that could be a lot harder than it looks.', '2007-06-04 00:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734629, 521270, 53690, '<td valign="top">Cool!  I really like the oranges/reds.  I''m not sure about the texture on the upper part of the hill, but I love the trees on both sides.</td>', 'Cool!  I really like the oranges/reds.  I''m not sure about the texture on the upper part of the hill, but I love the trees on both sides.', '2007-06-04 00:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734630, 521727, 53690, '<td valign="top">Great point of view and use of sepia or whatever you did.  The one thing I don''t like is the banding that goes across the background like a rainbow.  7 from me.</td>', 'Great point of view and use of sepia or whatever you did.  The one thing I don''t like is the banding that goes across the background like a rainbow.  7 from me.', '2007-06-04 00:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734633, 521996, 53690, '<td valign="top">wow, very cool.  That''s quite the residue left from whatever this substance is!  I really like all the different layers/colors in this.  It adds some good depth to the shot.</td>', 'wow, very cool.  That''s quite the residue left from whatever this substance is!  I really like all the different layers/colors in this.  It adds some good depth to the shot.', '2007-06-04 00:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734635, 522060, 53690, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sky.  It looks a bit grainy but I think it works in this shot.  Beautiful sunset in the background.</td>', 'Gorgeous sky.  It looks a bit grainy but I think it works in this shot.  Beautiful sunset in the background.', '2007-06-04 00:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734639, 521535, 53690, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot and had to look at it awhile at first.  I really like the square opening and think it works well with the rectangle crop.  The whole thing almost feels square because I''m so drawn in to the center.</td>', 'I like this a lot and had to look at it awhile at first.  I really like the square opening and think it works well with the rectangle crop.  The whole thing almost feels square because I''m so drawn in to the center.', '2007-06-04 00:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734645, 521321, 53690, '<td valign="top">This is really, really beautiful.  I like the contrast between the rushing and still water.  The reflection of the sun in the still water is really cool too.</td>', 'This is really, really beautiful.  I like the contrast between the rushing and still water.  The reflection of the sun in the still water is really cool too.', '2007-06-04 00:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734647, 520351, 53690, '<td valign="top">The colors in this shot are really cool.  I think a little more cropped off the top would make it just right.</td>', 'The colors in this shot are really cool.  I think a little more cropped off the top would make it just right.', '2007-06-04 00:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734648, 522326, 53690, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  I like the simplicity of the three lights and their reflections.</td>', 'Lovely.  I like the simplicity of the three lights and their reflections.', '2007-06-04 00:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734649, 521978, 53690, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation for the element of wind.  I like how it''s going toward the open sky and away from the big buildings.</td>', 'Great interpretation for the element of wind.  I like how it''s going toward the open sky and away from the big buildings.', '2007-06-04 00:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734653, 521273, 53690, '<td valign="top">I love the steel gray/blue colors in this.  It looks fantastic against the rocks.</td>', 'I love the steel gray/blue colors in this.  It looks fantastic against the rocks.', '2007-06-04 00:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734657, 521985, 20324, '<td valign="top">Well expressed texture of clouds, a little bit too oversaturated blue for my taste.</td>', 'Well expressed texture of clouds, a little bit too oversaturated blue for my taste.', '2007-06-04 00:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734659, 520993, 53690, '<td valign="top">Nice texture in the leaf, and the drop looks nice and sharp.</td>', 'Nice texture in the leaf, and the drop looks nice and sharp.', '2007-06-04 00:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734660, 521842, 53690, '<td valign="top">Very neat!  Wonder how you did the fire effect.  The water looks nice and crisp; it makes me thirsty!</td>', 'Very neat!  Wonder how you did the fire effect.  The water looks nice and crisp; it makes me thirsty!', '2007-06-04 00:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734666, 521257, 53690, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  The background is a bit noisy.  I especially notice it around the top right of the ant.  Nice use of complementary colors.</td>', 'Great capture.  The background is a bit noisy.  I especially notice it around the top right of the ant.  Nice use of complementary colors.', '2007-06-04 00:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734672, 519237, 53690, '<td valign="top">Beautiful water.  The rocks are a bit orange and distract me a bit.</td>', 'Beautiful water.  The rocks are a bit orange and distract me a bit.', '2007-06-04 00:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
