(3735683, 522285, 79242, '<td valign="top">I really think it is a shame that this picture did not do better. I thought it was remarkable. As for the comment about not being able to rate any black and white photo''s above a 5, I disagree. I think black and white makes at easier to focus on the details without distracting the eyes with color. That does not mean I like only B&amp;W, but sometimes it is just the best way to look at a photo. Great shot, still not the best in the competition but it was one of my favorites.</td>', 'I really think it is a shame that this picture did not do better. I thought it was remarkable. As for the comment about not being able to rate any black and white photo''s above a 5, I disagree. I think black and white makes at easier to focus on the details without distracting the eyes with color. That does not mean I like only B&W, but sometimes it is just the best way to look at a photo. Great shot, still not the best in the competition but it was one of my favorites.', '2007-06-04 03:59:10.000000', NULL, 0),
