(3735796, 519237, 19959, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Very unlucky not to ribbon IMO, especially with a 7+ score.<br/>This stood out as one of the best ''waterfall'' shots.. the location looks like it has a lot of potential. Do you have any out-takes?<br/> <br/>I like the saturated fern in the foreground.. I wonder what the shot would look like taken from slightly to the right.<br/> <br/>Any reason why the top of the falls is cropped out (bland sky perhaps?)<br/> <br/>Really nice photo. congratulations on the 4th place..<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-04 03:46:13.</i></td>', 'Nice shot. Very unlucky not to ribbon IMO, especially with a 7+ score.This stood out as one of the best ''waterfall'' shots.. the location looks like it has a lot of potential. Do you have any out-takes? I like the saturated fern in the foreground.. I wonder what the shot would look like taken from slightly to the right. Any reason why the top of the falls is cropped out (bland sky perhaps?) Really nice photo. congratulations on the 4th place..', '2007-06-04 04:45:18.000000', '2007-06-04 04:46:13.000000', 0),
