(3736033, 522303, 57060, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by IreneM:</b></div><hr/><i> This is such a lovely image. I''m very surprised that it didn''t do better. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Congratulations Ingrid on a beautiful shot, I guess I''m not too surprised at the overall score, this type of shot just doesn''t do well in the challenges which is a pity. Too bad more photographers on site dont appreciate something other than super-sharp, costumes, and over-satureated tone mapped colors. (Bit of a rant here, sorry) Again, beautiful shot and thanks for pushing DPC to look beyond "out of focus".<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Originally posted by IreneM: This is such a lovely image. I''m very surprised that it didn''t do better.   Congratulations Ingrid on a beautiful shot, I guess I''m not too surprised at the overall score, this type of shot just doesn''t do well in the challenges which is a pity. Too bad more photographers on site dont appreciate something other than super-sharp, costumes, and over-satureated tone mapped colors. (Bit of a rant here, sorry) Again, beautiful shot and thanks for pushing DPC to look beyond "out of focus". Jack', '2007-06-04 08:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
