(3736396, 519793, 40580, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments all.  Some of the best I''ve had so far.  This picture I took as a last minute picture.  The background was mixed coloring, so I made it B&amp;W.  <br/> <br/>It is dark because of the highlights from the flame.  Next time I''ll balence the lighting a bit more.<br/> <br/>Also, glass is annoying in that you need to have everything cleaned.  I don''t like the spots on the glass around the flame.<br/> <br/>Thanks again except to David Lopez.  Sorry Dave, but I need more than a 2 word comment to be helpful.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments all.  Some of the best I''ve had so far.  This picture I took as a last minute picture.  The background was mixed coloring, so I made it B&W.   It is dark because of the highlights from the flame.  Next time I''ll balence the lighting a bit more. Also, glass is annoying in that you need to have everything cleaned.  I don''t like the spots on the glass around the flame. Thanks again except to David Lopez.  Sorry Dave, but I need more than a 2 word comment to be helpful.', '2007-06-04 10:41:08.000000', NULL, 0),
