(3737017, 522372, 68035, '<td valign="top">OK I dont know whether to laugh or cry...I score 5.1125 and come 311th and you score 5.1250 and come 307th!!!!!! I swear I will beat you one day, but....I am glad it was not today because I had really liked this picture (way better than mine) and cant believe it did not score much higher.  For me it was one of the real unique images in the challenge and a great take on earth.<br/> <br/>I was going to ask about where you got the cat skull from but I guess that some things are better left unanswered<br/> <br/>Good job and way better than the score suggests</td>', 'OK I dont know whether to laugh or cry...I score 5.1125 and come 311th and you score 5.1250 and come 307th!!!!!! I swear I will beat you one day, but....I am glad it was not today because I had really liked this picture (way better than mine) and cant believe it did not score much higher.  For me it was one of the real unique images in the challenge and a great take on earth. I was going to ask about where you got the cat skull from but I guess that some things are better left unanswered Good job and way better than the score suggests', '2007-06-04 13:33:13.000000', NULL, 0),
