(3737239, 521243, 67697, '<td valign="top">What a fun picture.  You have no idea how thrilled my boys would be if i told them to go stand in a pot of soil.  OF COURSE within 2 seconds it would be everywhere - which is why i do not ask lol.  Is her dress supposed to represent a flower?  I agree with what someone else said about the dress being lower - something about it is distracting but i cannot put a finger on it.  Anyway, very creative!  Congrats on a nice score.</td>', 'What a fun picture.  You have no idea how thrilled my boys would be if i told them to go stand in a pot of soil.  OF COURSE within 2 seconds it would be everywhere - which is why i do not ask lol.  Is her dress supposed to represent a flower?  I agree with what someone else said about the dress being lower - something about it is distracting but i cannot put a finger on it.  Anyway, very creative!  Congrats on a nice score.', '2007-06-04 14:23:58.000000', NULL, 0),
