(3737610, 518496, 44877, '<td valign="top">You got <i>one</i> comment? That''s brutal. This is a good shot, Jon. A little fuzzy, but that seemed to be the issue with my dirt photo, too. That was a total last minute chop job - threw some dirt in a tub and tossed in the skull. My double take photo is of similarly awful unthoughtfulness. <br/> <br/>Though I keep on beating you (muahahahahaha!!!), your average is still way higher than mine. :o|<br/> <br/>The cat skull - I have several - and several live cats, too. I seem to run across bones, antlers and skulls and have a liking for those things - don''t ask...</td>', 'You got one comment? That''s brutal. This is a good shot, Jon. A little fuzzy, but that seemed to be the issue with my dirt photo, too. That was a total last minute chop job - threw some dirt in a tub and tossed in the skull. My double take photo is of similarly awful unthoughtfulness.  Though I keep on beating you (muahahahahaha!!!), your average is still way higher than mine. :o| The cat skull - I have several - and several live cats, too. I seem to run across bones, antlers and skulls and have a liking for those things - don''t ask...', '2007-06-04 15:38:05.000000', NULL, 0),
