(3737783, 521722, 93, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by lissylou:</b></div><hr/><i> I really like this.  Was the red and blue in the faucet an accident?  I think it adds a neat touch, like hot and cold. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No.. not an accident.  I did hue-shift the colors that were there to make them a bit more pleasing, but I didn''t want the image to stay completely monochromatic, so I but a couple of objects to the sides to reflect some color.</td>', 'Originally posted by lissylou: I really like this.  Was the red and blue in the faucet an accident?  I think it adds a neat touch, like hot and cold.   No.. not an accident.  I did hue-shift the colors that were there to make them a bit more pleasing, but I didn''t want the image to stay completely monochromatic, so I but a couple of objects to the sides to reflect some color.', '2007-06-04 16:37:17.000000', NULL, 0),
