(3744880, 521024, 43410, '<td valign="top"><b>I would like to thank everyone that commented on my image.  I really appreciate it, so very much more than you all could possibly know.  I''ve wanted a ribbon for so long, and thanks to people like all of you, I have been able to do so.  I really appreciate the words of encouragement.  You''re all great, thanks again.  Now let''s see if I can get another, so i''m not a "One Hit Wonder", huh L? :P </b></td>', 'I would like to thank everyone that commented on my image.  I really appreciate it, so very much more than you all could possibly know.  I''ve wanted a ribbon for so long, and thanks to people like all of you, I have been able to do so.  I really appreciate the words of encouragement.  You''re all great, thanks again.  Now let''s see if I can get another, so i''m not a "One Hit Wonder", huh L? :P ', '2007-06-06 01:32:38.000000', NULL, 0),
