(3750517, 522011, 47316, '<td valign="top">So you are my first official reaction club comment. :)<br/> <br/>First impression was, that''s pretty! Seems like somewhere I''d like to be and somewhere I certainly would be inclined to take a photograph.<br/> <br/>Looking at it further I think it''s almost too much to take in and too much green. (Funny I just noticed people said not enough! But I mean area wise, not vibrancy as they did) The bridge seems like something I''d like to see more of, it looks really interesting.</td>', 'So you are my first official reaction club comment. :) First impression was, that''s pretty! Seems like somewhere I''d like to be and somewhere I certainly would be inclined to take a photograph. Looking at it further I think it''s almost too much to take in and too much green. (Funny I just noticed people said not enough! But I mean area wise, not vibrancy as they did) The bridge seems like something I''d like to see more of, it looks really interesting.', '2007-06-07 04:41:46.000000', NULL, 0),
