(3753116, 522243, 64795, '<td valign="top">I CANNOT believe this scored so low.  I thought it would make top 10.  I gave it an 8, but now I wish I gave a 10.  This is just a beautiful picture. :) The DOF is <b>perfect</b>, the soil color is <b>magical</b>, and the angle is <b>inspired</b>.  Haha! Anyways... great job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-07 18:19:29.</i></td>', 'I CANNOT believe this scored so low.  I thought it would make top 10.  I gave it an 8, but now I wish I gave a 10.  This is just a beautiful picture. :) The DOF is perfect, the soil color is magical, and the angle is inspired.  Haha! Anyways... great job!', '2007-06-07 19:19:15.000000', '2007-06-07 19:19:29.000000', 0),
