(3757154, 522243, 23394, '<td valign="top">curious as to why this scored where it did?<br/> <br/>for starters, because a large majority of people disagree with daboardergirl''s assessment ;-)<br/> <br/>just trying to keep this simple:<br/> <br/>technically, the focus is weird.  the dof is so shallow that you can''t get a real sense of the subject, mainly because you can''t tell what''s in front and what''s in back.  if all the sprouts had been in focus, the image would have registered with most viewers a little easier.<br/> <br/>as for meeting the challenge, it''s a bit of a stretch to call this ''earth'' when the earth is not the subject or the focus.  the earth is just there, and it''s not really fair to ask the voters to make the leap that having something in the image is the same thing as making that something the image.  maybe if you has drenched the sprouts and made the water drops extremely visible.<br/> <br/>wow factor?  nada.  the colors are nice, but this isn''t an image that is going to arrest the viewer, let alone the voter.<br/> <br/>in the end, this image scored about where it should have.  obviously not one of your better outings, but definitely nothing to question yourself over.</td>', 'curious as to why this scored where it did? for starters, because a large majority of people disagree with daboardergirl''s assessment ;-) just trying to keep this simple: technically, the focus is weird.  the dof is so shallow that you can''t get a real sense of the subject, mainly because you can''t tell what''s in front and what''s in back.  if all the sprouts had been in focus, the image would have registered with most viewers a little easier. as for meeting the challenge, it''s a bit of a stretch to call this ''earth'' when the earth is not the subject or the focus.  the earth is just there, and it''s not really fair to ask the voters to make the leap that having something in the image is the same thing as making that something the image.  maybe if you has drenched the sprouts and made the water drops extremely visible. wow factor?  nada.  the colors are nice, but this isn''t an image that is going to arrest the viewer, let alone the voter. in the end, this image scored about where it should have.  obviously not one of your better outings, but definitely nothing to question yourself over.', '2007-06-08 12:27:50.000000', NULL, 0),
