(3763472, 521767, 55838, '<td valign="top">Wild color!  I never would of guessed that it wasn''t due to heavy-handed editing.  Amazing.  Good choice to make the back blue.  I think my eyes are missing at least one area of very clean focus.  I didn''t vote on this.</td>', 'Wild color!  I never would of guessed that it wasn''t due to heavy-handed editing.  Amazing.  Good choice to make the back blue.  I think my eyes are missing at least one area of very clean focus.  I didn''t vote on this.', '2007-06-10 15:50:47.000000', NULL, 0),
