(3779701, 520611, 60862, '<td valign="top">Susan, I think you''ve found an interesting angle, but I keep wanting more contrast.  The tones seem all down in the dark end.  Also, I agree with dr rick about the angle - I wonder whether there''s some way to keep the fence out of the picture?<br/> <br/>Finally, what''s a "frost hydrant"?  A well that keeps running in winter?</td>', 'Susan, I think you''ve found an interesting angle, but I keep wanting more contrast.  The tones seem all down in the dark end.  Also, I agree with dr rick about the angle - I wonder whether there''s some way to keep the fence out of the picture? Finally, what''s a "frost hydrant"?  A well that keeps running in winter?', '2007-06-13 18:31:54.000000', NULL, 0),
