(3814596, 521889, 19474, '<td valign="top">I seem to be getting lots of comments on my photos from you so it is about time I returned the complement so I''ll pick on some of your less commented on shots <i>I hope I don''t pick on them too much :)</i> <br/>1st off this should have scored a lot higher than a 5.1<br/>that said, while it is a busy photo, it is the dead spaces that if removed would greatly enhance the photo. you have to much sky and grass and it over powers the main subjects as I see them<br/>this would look better cropped in a panoramic style buy cropping the sky at the top of the cloud that touches the left hand side and cropping half the grass at the bottom (use a couple of pieces of paper against you monitor thats how I check) I think it still keeps enough of the great sky while bringing out the detail more</td>', 'I seem to be getting lots of comments on my photos from you so it is about time I returned the complement so I''ll pick on some of your less commented on shots I hope I don''t pick on them too much :) 1st off this should have scored a lot higher than a 5.1that said, while it is a busy photo, it is the dead spaces that if removed would greatly enhance the photo. you have to much sky and grass and it over powers the main subjects as I see themthis would look better cropped in a panoramic style buy cropping the sky at the top of the cloud that touches the left hand side and cropping half the grass at the bottom (use a couple of pieces of paper against you monitor thats how I check) I think it still keeps enough of the great sky while bringing out the detail more', '2007-06-21 11:15:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3815585, 521718, 45524, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Scholten:</b></div><hr/><i> I am probably a small minority, but I have difficulty rating any B&amp;W photos higher than a 5, when todays photographic technology makes vivid and vibrant color so easy. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Wow thats all I can say.</td>', 'Originally posted by Scholten: I am probably a small minority, but I have difficulty rating any B&W photos higher than a 5, when todays photographic technology makes vivid and vibrant color so easy.   Wow thats all I can say.', '2007-06-21 14:14:08.000000', NULL, 0),
