(3822204, 521068, 27812, '<td valign="top">This is indeed a pic from a Photography Book.... or rather should be. I am impressed by the quality of color management as these shots are notoriously difficult to bring to life.<br/> <br/>Please do yourself a favour, buy Dan Margulis''s book titled ''Photoshop LAB Color''. A difficult read but once you grasp the basics and start playing with it, the results are astonishing.<br/> <br/>This pic would have been scored a 10 by me.<br/></td>', 'This is indeed a pic from a Photography Book.... or rather should be. I am impressed by the quality of color management as these shots are notoriously difficult to bring to life. Please do yourself a favour, buy Dan Margulis''s book titled ''Photoshop LAB Color''. A difficult read but once you grasp the basics and start playing with it, the results are astonishing. This pic would have been scored a 10 by me.', '2007-06-22 22:54:49.000000', NULL, 0),
