(4927122, 522207, 44877, '<td valign="top">Hey Roz - I don''t remember this photo at all, though per the red bar, I voted it a 7 at the time. <br/> <br/>Looking at it now, it''s totally amazing - I love the lightness, the white vignette, the smoothness, the water drinker''s expression and the beautiful glass. <br/> <br/>And reading the comments, the voters really didn''t get it, did they? Too bad, because this should have scored a whole point higher. You were just ahead of your time, my friend.</td>', 'Hey Roz - I don''t remember this photo at all, though per the red bar, I voted it a 7 at the time.  Looking at it now, it''s totally amazing - I love the lightness, the white vignette, the smoothness, the water drinker''s expression and the beautiful glass.  And reading the comments, the voters really didn''t get it, did they? Too bad, because this should have scored a whole point higher. You were just ahead of your time, my friend.', '2008-09-02 02:51:11.000000', NULL, 0),
